{"id":"ac5b2b37-bfb9-4cd5-906b-da2c1a3e289e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"This method extracts an archive URL from the given jarUrl. Since the method returns a URL on all code paths from the snippet, result should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#extractArchiveURL(URL):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.541663367Z"}
