{"id":"77b93904-335d-4921-9170-767aaf51f7f8","expr":"root != null","rationale":"The method calls root.toString() and uses root as a base URL, so root must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.550266604Z"}
