{"id":"4dd24712-cccc-453c-a7f7-6479f43abf04","expr":"!messageDigest.getAlgorithm().isEmpty()","rationale":"A messageDigest instance should have a non-empty algorithm name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.551057313Z"}
{"id":"44899f9d-8f05-4d50-ad9f-8cbd3ac9c2e2","expr":"messageDigest.getProvider() != null","rationale":"The MessageDigest instance should have a cryptographic provider configured.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.551057313Z"}
{"id":"fc91c85c-5ec7-40dd-9203-80378e98cc65","expr":"messageDigest != null && messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null && !messageDigest.getAlgorithm().isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method updates the MessageDigest, it should be initialized with a valid algorithm.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555059287Z"}
{"id":"070bf2aa-31bb-42f9-bdd2-6ab378756dcc","expr":"root.toString().length() > 0","rationale":"root.toString() represents the base URL string and should be non-empty for a valid URL path manipulation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.550266604Z"}
{"id":"c22a7525-1586-4afd-ae30-8bcbe0d0ac67","expr":"relativePath.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length must be non-negative; trivial but valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.550266604Z"}
{"id":"ea1471b0-d8b3-41e7-95be-8c232ca9819d","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"messageDigest must be non-null to update it later in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555387525Z"}
{"id":"042fbd87-fbc2-4e50-8ca8-dd12c6e48c78","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"Length parameter should be non-negative indicating a valid byte count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555387525Z"}
{"id":"c7af3b6c-3420-493b-b702-3e2edad99ead","expr":"len == 0 || len > 0","rationale":"This invariant restates that len is a non-negative number.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555387525Z"}
{"id":"d6058f0a-1bd0-4bf4-b8a5-6846a15e5f5e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new URI constructed from the location string, so result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.557433808Z"}
{"id":"1b0e8521-ce36-45d4-bfc4-f1ec5d4faaa4","expr":"result.toString().equals(location == null ? null : location.replace(\" \", \"%20\"))","rationale":"The URI's string form should be the location string with spaces replaced by %20.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.557433808Z"}
{"id":"2799c6fd-64a6-40ad-aba3-e3be2592b606","expr":"location == null || location.contains(\" \") || result.toString().equals(location)","rationale":"If location has spaces, replaced by %20; if no spaces or null, toString may equal location.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.557433808Z"}
{"id":"c13817a0-6d63-4bb1-90d6-d52044c46543","expr":"len >= 0","rationale":"Since len indicates the number of bytes to update, it cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558238974Z"}
{"id":"3f28b502-3516-4a76-a16c-d720d2881e66","expr":"messageDigest.getDigestLength() > 0","rationale":"Digest length indicates output size; it must be positive for a valid instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555059287Z"}
{"id":"24f6fa22-20e5-4afd-9dd2-a31a2c385db4","expr":"messageDigest.digest() != null","rationale":"After update, the digest method returns computed data, which must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555059287Z"}
{"id":"8c82f5d7-567e-4773-ad13-3359c64bbc51","expr":"messageDigest.toString() != null","rationale":"Calling toString() on MessageDigest should never return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555059287Z"}
{"id":"08a64056-7e1b-4d15-8cdf-566709fba3de","expr":"messageDigest.getAlgorithm().length() > 0","rationale":"Algorithm name must be a non-empty string representing the algorithm used.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.555059287Z"}
{"id":"9b6f8dfc-957e-4730-b1a3-c65dd5a694a3","expr":"messageDigest != null","rationale":"The method uses messageDigest.update(), so the messageDigest must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558238974Z"}
{"id":"211f7643-d18c-4cac-9163-d35e125412c6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a URL object constructed from the 'location', so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558599673Z"}
{"id":"18f9a54a-ec7d-4ee4-9d28-a9297ce34c7a","expr":"(location != null) && (result.toString().contains(location) || result.toString().equals(location))","rationale":"The URL returned is constructed from the given 'location', so the string form of 'result' should reflect 'location'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558599673Z"}
{"id":"4d5195dd-b400-42ca-b0df-015e001c3726","expr":"result.getProtocol() != null && !result.getProtocol().isEmpty()","rationale":"Constructed URLs must have a non-null, non-empty protocol part.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURL(String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558599673Z"}
{"id":"d92f55ef-c0ac-4da6-99d3-0b8b1bb3ad63","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a new URL object created using the URL constructor, the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.563654309Z"}
{"id":"10a1285c-b8e2-4011-a202-0817432f04f4","expr":"result.toString().startsWith(root.toString())","rationale":"The method creates result relative to root, so typically the result URL string starts with the root URL string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toRelativeURL(URL,String):URL","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.563654309Z"}
{"id":"8f5d8be7-e3f6-4535-98fa-dd68a478d6c0","expr":"result.isAbsolute() || !location.startsWith(\"/\")","rationale":"Absolute URI characteristic is related to how the location string is formed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.557433808Z"}
{"id":"499b0169-b93c-405d-8758-65122f125a06","expr":"(len == 0) || (messageDigest.getAlgorithm() != null)","rationale":"If len is zero, no update occurs and no invariant on algorithm is needed; otherwise, messageDigest usually has a non-null algorithm.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.UpdateMessageDigestInputStream#updateMessageDigest(MessageDigest,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/UpdateMessageDigestInputStream.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.558238974Z"}
{"id":"39764601-930d-4030-bd13-8dcff8df6d47","expr":"result.getScheme() == null || location.startsWith(result.getScheme())","rationale":"The location string format relates to the URI scheme extracted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ResourceUtils#toURI(String):URI","file":"org/springframework/util/ResourceUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:48.557433808Z"}
{"id":"fe9fd0ba-b3bc-476c-847b-9c816e2755dd","expr":"result == false || (pattern != null && str != null)","rationale":"From the contract, the method returns false if either parameter is null, so if the result is true both must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.429140763Z"}
{"id":"6a1dfce9-f37a-4fa4-b677-ece9a1c32a74","expr":"!result || (pattern.length() >= 0 && str.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If the method returns true, both strings must be non-null (implied by previous invariant), so their length properties exist and are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.429140763Z"}
{"id":"354385a2-e1cc-4444-8488-e011ae1ef37d","expr":"result == false || !pattern.isEmpty()","rationale":"It is generally expected that to produce a match, a pattern is non-empty. Empty pattern likely leads to false result or special behavior.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.429140763Z"}
{"id":"414b8763-2108-4ed6-b68f-1210def8934f","expr":"result == false || !str.isEmpty()","rationale":"To match, the string must generally not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.429140763Z"}
{"id":"244a1652-0f0e-4704-83c7-2e63142cd79e","expr":"pattern != null && str != null || !result == false","rationale":"If pattern or str is null, the method returns false, so result is false in that case.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatchIgnoreCase(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.431804968Z"}
{"id":"2410568e-ff8e-434d-8dc3-38d1d76ec9ec","expr":"!result || (pattern.equalsIgnoreCase(pattern) && str.equalsIgnoreCase(str))","rationale":"When result is true, the inputs are non-null, and string comparisons ignoring case hold.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatchIgnoreCase(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.431804968Z"}
{"id":"324415f7-bf6f-401b-ac63-568516c5c17d","expr":"!result || pattern.length() <= str.length() + 2","rationale":"This bounds the pattern length relative to str length when a match could occur.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatchIgnoreCase(String,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.431804968Z"}
{"id":"05a1b98f-4220-4ed2-978f-26fe0893ad55","expr":"pattern != null || str == null","rationale":"The first check in the method is if pattern or str is null, the method returns false, so logically if pattern is null then str should be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.432716915Z"}
{"id":"254c8b9c-c48a-47f1-9349-3638ab0c4d69","expr":"str != null || pattern == null","rationale":"From the null checks, if str is null then pattern must be null or method won't proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.432716915Z"}
{"id":"872b7b51-8a6c-4e36-958d-40209cf1c1a9","expr":"ignoreCase == true || ignoreCase == false","rationale":"ignoreCase is boolean so inherently either true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.432716915Z"}
{"id":"d8bc88e6-2b60-4fb5-ad10-3fe77d1dc4fe","expr":"str != null && pattern != null","rationale":"The method starts by returning false if either pattern or str is null, so at the method entry, both may be possibly null but for meaningful processing both should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.PatternMatchUtils#simpleMatch(String,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/PatternMatchUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:49.432716915Z"}
