{"id":"81078a11-fc03-4690-adb7-5374bdbf3204","expr":"result == null || line.indexOf(result) >= 0","rationale":"If result is not null, it is obtained as line.substring(index), so it must appear inside line.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:50.793375814Z"}
