{"id":"cbe52b6a-8419-4723-b84b-55bd4dfe497c","expr":"line != null","rationale":"The method expects a string to check for a comment, so line being non-null is a common precondition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#startComment(String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:50.799420324Z"}
