{"id":"043e15bb-9b6b-40d3-a1b2-bc493dce05ba","expr":"data.indexOf(\"]]>\" ) == -1","rationale":"The content of CData cannot contain the CData end marker sequence because that would break the XML structure.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.070565089Z"}
