{"id":"dce994d6-04bb-43e7-9551-37a9181844f5","expr":"text != null","rationale":"The method usage of text in createCharacters likely expects a non-null argument.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.071129011Z"}
