{"id":"e54c792a-c611-4c53-99ef-5370b553c4ba","expr":"text != null","rationale":"Because 'text' is used as the backing array for creating a String, it cannot be null to avoid a NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.071037699Z"}
