{"id":"22a4daeb-ec38-42b1-9ef5-e5800a98a32c","expr":"text != null","rationale":"Since the method uses text to create characters event, text is expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.080500605Z"}
