{"id":"489c884a-1f59-41c0-88c1-75927552167f","expr":"!data.startsWith(\"-\")","rationale":"XML comments should not start with a hyphen.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeComment(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.083248768Z"}
{"id":"b4d91ced-20b8-47dc-94ae-7849a991401c","expr":"data != null","rationale":"The method likely expects non-null input data to create a CDATA event.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.087591845Z"}
{"id":"2a0f05d4-ebd0-45b7-8bda-d3c6911c617f","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Data is a valid string and thus its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.087591845Z"}
{"id":"0f3b487e-25dd-43c0-a296-88f3d1674e82","expr":"!data.contains(\"]]>\" )","rationale":"The data for CDATA should not contain the CDATA termination sequence to be well-formed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.087591845Z"}
{"id":"645c90bc-d396-4a7e-942f-75815c6314a6","expr":"data.indexOf(\"<\") == -1 || data.indexOf(\">\") == -1 || data.indexOf(\"<\") < data.indexOf(\">\")","rationale":"Ensures that if there are < and > characters, their order is valid or one is missing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCData(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.087591845Z"}
