{"id":"6afef248-567a-4662-8645-831fa1851828","expr":"text != null","rationale":"The method creates a String using 'text', so it must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.091572109Z"}
{"id":"ab0b81e1-9949-4121-a632-002bcde21a68","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"'start' is used as the starting index in the String constructor and must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeCharacters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.091572109Z"}
