{"id":"7aecf7c7-40b1-46b9-8caf-33132608682c","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The input character array must be non-null because the String constructor called with (char[], int, int) throws NullPointerException if ch is null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.292858273Z"}
{"id":"1d197041-e3e6-450f-9296-57e1957cf4ad","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The start index must be non-negative as it is used by the String constructor to indicate the starting index in the character array","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.292858273Z"}
