{"id":"996f1491-6c43-4f9e-9359-084d92d1abcd","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The sum of start and length must be <= ch.length for the constructor new String(ch, start, length) to be valid and not raise an IndexOutOfBoundsException","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.292858273Z"}
{"id":"ae7736da-7c7e-4f2b-8b10-71f3b9ff7850","expr":"length == 0 || start < ch.length","rationale":"If length is positive then start must be less than array length otherwise the substring is invalid","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.292858273Z"}
{"id":"1da2358c-1563-418c-a891-e54a813f2d9c","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The array 'ch' must be non-null to create a new String from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.294683390Z"}
{"id":"99c14630-6adf-4fca-ac9e-e9a98ed968f1","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"'start' must be zero or positive to be a valid index into the array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.294683390Z"}
{"id":"4a088623-f73a-4555-82b0-caacdd85ef25","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"'length' must be zero or positive for the substring length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.294683390Z"}
{"id":"1335a793-5db5-464d-8c50-9b906772db71","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The substring from 'start' to 'start + length' must fit inside 'ch' array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.294683390Z"}
{"id":"41d7d619-cbc3-4531-a510-389168723526","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Safe construction of the String from the char array with given start and length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.295458850Z"}
{"id":"b19803af-a09f-4863-84f6-f72f1d15d7a8","expr":"length == 0 || ch.length > 0","rationale":"If 'length' is positive, 'ch' must contain characters to extract from.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.295458850Z"}
{"id":"78c41201-2cf7-4bd3-a47c-d6f5fae2e895","expr":"uri != null && (qName == null || qName.contains(localName))","rationale":"Qualified name 'qName' typically includes the namespace prefix followed by ':' and then the localName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.290820347Z"}
{"id":"789e5200-8553-4a7f-a307-a4340409bb6b","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because endElement is called on a specific element, localName is expected to be a meaningful non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.290820347Z"}
{"id":"16c92c5d-d116-4807-9ade-2617913be70c","expr":"(qName == null || !qName.isEmpty())","rationale":"qName should not be an empty string, since it represents the qualified name of element.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.290820347Z"}
{"id":"668b6392-7ac5-47c5-a194-8d4c94f84bc8","expr":"uri != null || (localName != null && qName != null)","rationale":"This captures that either the namespace URI exists or both localName and qName do, assuming namespace awareness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.290820347Z"}
{"id":"0ea8a9b2-c4c3-40aa-9422-09e64fa8fbe6","expr":"qName == null || qName.startsWith(uri) || !uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures consistent relationship between uri and qName's prefix (though not guaranteed in all contexts)","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.290820347Z"}
{"id":"d6ecaca8-c583-4125-83fa-ce5f767c76ea","expr":"start >= 0 && length >= 0","rationale":"start and length are used to create a substring from the char array, so both must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.298974679Z"}
{"id":"f55d6165-176a-4f05-8cff-6e968747feb2","expr":"prefix != null","rationale":"The prefix is used as a key in a map, so it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.293274207Z"}
{"id":"1dcf9a64-8114-4b90-949d-9d9469bcb3b2","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The constructor String(ch, start, length) requires ch to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.298974679Z"}
{"id":"84473457-9d38-46a5-b18d-53c3edb69eef","expr":"qName != null && !qName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The qName parameter is expected to be a valid XML qualified name, therefore non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.299051143Z"}
{"id":"7f151fde-0589-4fc4-9cb9-0ef11a31abf2","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"To safely create new String(ch, start, length), the boundaries must be inside ch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.298974679Z"}
{"id":"519e1235-64b5-4027-9e37-be2096b7451b","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"The uri is used as a value in a map, it is likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.293274207Z"}
{"id":"30b1e833-2f8b-4dfa-a625-38f41b2840d2","expr":"!prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace prefix usually is not empty in XML context.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.293274207Z"}
{"id":"2fd63015-f1cc-4844-b665-e920c2c6815e","expr":"!uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"Namespace uri is usually a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.293274207Z"}
{"id":"d7690249-0b1c-43bb-8eec-e7989350f389","expr":"target != null","rationale":"The processingInstructionInternal method likely requires a non-null target to identify the target of the processing instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.302490147Z"}
{"id":"6492aadc-70a1-4c94-bff5-ba9d35df3d49","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Since data is passed to processingInstructionInternal, it is plausible that data must be at least a valid string, possibly empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.302490147Z"}
{"id":"e0dfd3b1-0ae2-413a-8dec-3412f216eb87","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"Processing instructions generally have a non-empty target to specify the instruction name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.302490147Z"}
{"id":"4a298992-cb61-424d-9ef4-22b2d3a24e0b","expr":"!target.contains(\"<?\")","rationale":"The target string should not contain processing instruction start delimiters which might be invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:51.302490147Z"}
