{"id":"a7d52e26-6d24-4ff7-b50f-d141caed6a33","expr":"!resourcePath.contains(\".\") || result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"If the original resource path contains dots, then the result must also contain dots, since dots are not removed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#convertResourcePathToClassName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.463421193Z"}
