{"id":"a8663202-230e-4a43-96d3-52470e8c7943","expr":"object != null","rationale":"The method calls object.getClass(), so object must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxy(Object):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.649768663Z"}
