{"id":"fb62918c-1e74-45a3-af59-1c80eb87db16","expr":"result == (clazz.isMemberClass() && !clazz.isStatic())","rationale":"Assuming isStaticClass delegates to clazz.isStatic(), the returned value matches that expression.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.650525428Z"}
{"id":"fbe3e481-fccc-48ad-a209-c6b68a6fdb30","expr":"result == false || clazz.isMemberClass()","rationale":"If it is considered an inner class, it must satisfy being a member class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isInnerClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.650525428Z"}
