{"id":"de4a6fb8-d98d-4119-9167-a72f9b9c39d7","expr":"result == (className != null && className.contains(\"$$\"))","rationale":"The method returns true only if className is not null and contains the CGLIB_CLASS_SEPARATOR \"$$\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.676785517Z"}
