{"id":"544be8b4-5473-4963-8602-e592e8a4fa40","expr":"result.getName() != null","rationale":"Ensures the returned Class object represents a valid class with a proper name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Object):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.680040405Z"}
{"id":"e80dbab1-a1f8-4398-9568-072c87fccfb9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either the superclass or clazz itself, both of which are expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.696786262Z"}
{"id":"c8942258-3727-451d-9108-adbd33a001b1","expr":"result == clazz || (clazz.getName().contains(\"$$\") && result == clazz.getSuperclass())","rationale":"If the class name contains the CGLIB proxy separator, the result is the superclass; otherwise, the result is clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.696786262Z"}
{"id":"8905a0a7-bc36-45e4-b84f-6e6d10c3d9b1","expr":"value == null || value.getClass() != null","rationale":"If value is not null then getClass() must return a valid Class object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.697165856Z"}
