{"id":"ff69c863-cdb2-4ec2-aae8-8eda4b52acfd","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().getTypeName() != null","rationale":"The type name of the class should not be null if value is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.697165856Z"}
{"id":"d596f4ef-044d-4301-a122-c5bff115b756","expr":"result == clazz || clazz.getSuperclass() == result","rationale":"Reflects that the method returns clazz or its superclass if criteria met.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getUserClass(Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.696786262Z"}
{"id":"453f08c5-5116-4fa3-96a8-8fb2eae4cb03","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The Class.getInterfaces() should return a non-null array even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.697165856Z"}
{"id":"fec99780-b034-410c-beb3-58be404947ba","expr":"!result || clazz != null","rationale":"If result is true, then clazz must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.698213769Z"}
{"id":"d9087229-e79f-4de3-a036-aad2891f06ea","expr":"clazz == null || !result || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Ensuring it is safe to call getName if clazz is not null and method returns true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClass(Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.698213769Z"}
{"id":"a5af051d-5f88-4fc1-a87b-21db6accf122","expr":"(value == null && result == null) || (value != null && result != null)","rationale":"The method returns null only if the input value is null. Otherwise, the result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.707204936Z"}
{"id":"a989c22f-9c81-44cc-a0b3-5bea4d2643e4","expr":"value == null || result.length() >= value.getClass().getTypeName().length()","rationale":"The descriptive type string includes at least the class type name, so the length of the result is at least the length of the class's type name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getDescriptiveType(Object):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.707204936Z"}
