{"id":"25c87751-90b6-4dea-aaf4-5d2a11cc592a","expr":"clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"The getTypeName method of Class returns a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.708528889Z"}
{"id":"bce9896e-9e85-4c61-b4e9-0b9b1c4c503a","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName() != null","rationale":"The getSimpleName method of Class returns a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.708528889Z"}
{"id":"51406b10-bf7c-4202-bcc7-c14e0c703f37","expr":"clazz.getTypeName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class type names are typically non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.708528889Z"}
{"id":"e1487d62-e336-417a-9708-e86e5f8fd74d","expr":"className == null || className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"If className is not null, it may contain the CGLIB class separator indicating a Cglib proxy class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.717990853Z"}
{"id":"6224bdb8-aa4f-44b3-a591-bd59b8dcfc57","expr":"className == null || className.length() >= 2","rationale":"If className is not null and contains the separator, it must have some length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.717990853Z"}
{"id":"636a3e2c-dc09-47ba-b200-d8f5418791cd","expr":"className == null || !className.isEmpty()","rationale":"If className is not null, it logically should not be empty as that cannot contain the separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.717990853Z"}
{"id":"00babedd-3267-4937-abf0-2f029668f90c","expr":"className != null || !className.contains(\"$$\")","rationale":"If className is null, it does not contain the CGLIB class separator.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isCglibProxyClassName(String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.717990853Z"}
{"id":"68a5a0db-48bb-49df-a3cb-b0578b6f0f43","expr":"typeName != null || !result","rationale":"If the method returns true, typeName is guaranteed to be non-null due to the explicit check.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.724786226Z"}
{"id":"92f39d69-4601-4d2a-acdb-f7554133877a","expr":"!result || typeName.equals(clazz.getTypeName()) || typeName.equals(clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"If result is true, then typeName must equal either clazz.getTypeName() or clazz.getSimpleName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.724786226Z"}
{"id":"c7ea8246-8b6d-4e42-9af3-0753a4cb9545","expr":"result == (typeName != null && (typeName.equals(clazz.getTypeName()) || typeName.equals(clazz.getSimpleName())))","rationale":"Result reflects the exact return expression in the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.724786226Z"}
{"id":"02c27142-9e99-4704-b331-a539ebf325a0","expr":"!result || (clazz.getTypeName() != null && clazz.getSimpleName() != null)","rationale":"If the method returns true, then clazz.getTypeName() and clazz.getSimpleName() must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#matchesTypeName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.724786226Z"}
{"id":"fbd2a2f7-450a-4694-91d2-10cb604c4e19","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null Class object to operate on.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.727931618Z"}
{"id":"0eb21fd0-0210-444b-a698-cedf23e8e81c","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"Short name extraction generally applies to non-array classes, or arrays would have a different representation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.727931618Z"}
{"id":"4d35e47e-e139-45f9-9ae7-750c5b4dd9d4","expr":"clazz.getName().endsWith('.' + clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"The simple name is the suffix of the full class name separated by '.'","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.727931618Z"}
{"id":"21512ba4-eb11-4192-a25d-5a04aa7324db","expr":"clazz.getEnclosingClass() == null || clazz.getSimpleName().length() > 0","rationale":"If a class is nested (has enclosing class), its simple name is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.727931618Z"}
{"id":"c3702cfd-755e-43de-9571-3c48936e900f","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The clazz parameter must be non-null to derive a short name from it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.736486183Z"}
{"id":"45991115-3575-4067-beb0-5c6b5298894c","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The method asserts className has length, so it cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.741795940Z"}
{"id":"0cfb078b-7b4b-4306-b771-a8cf1466b6bb","expr":"className.length() > 0","rationale":"The method verifies className is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.741795940Z"}
{"id":"989f2403-5403-4624-bf51-d4253fe36de4","expr":"className.lastIndexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"lastIndexOf method is used and its return value is >= -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.741795940Z"}
{"id":"5f4c3a50-1c79-44e5-a1ee-c235a6116676","expr":"className.indexOf(\"$$\") >= -1","rationale":"indexOf with CGLIB_CLASS_SEPARATOR may be -1 or higher.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.741795940Z"}
{"id":"56efc70f-b847-404f-908a-e8fed2744390","expr":"className.length() >= 1","rationale":"className cannot be empty, so length is at least 1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.741795940Z"}
{"id":"ce288b50-1941-4330-9422-a82182f4aea3","expr":"result != null && result.length() > 0","rationale":"The result is obtained by taking a substring of className between indices and then replacing characters. Since className has length, result should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.753642613Z"}
{"id":"f695c7a8-f187-4c83-97f3-f73f76e96941","expr":"result.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The '.' character (PACKAGE_SEPARATOR) is replaced in nested classes by PACKAGE_SEPARATOR, so result should not contain '.'","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.753642613Z"}
{"id":"62e93a36-3752-407e-b22d-fd72f64fae90","expr":"result.indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"The nested class separator ('$') is replaced by '.', so '$' should not appear in result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.753642613Z"}
{"id":"6ff76f05-fa1f-494b-b58f-4e38b2b589ae","expr":"className.endsWith(result) || className.contains(result)","rationale":"Result is a substring of className after the last dot, possibly replacing '$' by '.'. So result is related to an ending segment of className.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.753642613Z"}
{"id":"72600f1c-1f56-4bc7-affa-1ce1b568852a","expr":"result.endsWith(\".class\")","rationale":"The method appends CLASS_FILE_SUFFIX ('.class') to the substring to form the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.756658962Z"}
{"id":"3c6a0aa4-14cf-4afe-8f2a-da7c468f0e4f","expr":"result.length() > 6","rationale":"Since result is substring plus \".class\", it must be longer than just the suffix length 6.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.756658962Z"}
{"id":"dc70caea-a298-44fe-bc46-10cdcac2be8b","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getSimpleName() + \".class\")","rationale":"The last part of the class name matches clazz.getSimpleName(), so result equals simple name + \".class\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.756658962Z"}
{"id":"279f8eb8-7dec-4ffe-928c-11f819dcf682","expr":"result.charAt(0) == clazz.getSimpleName().charAt(0)","rationale":"The result is derived from the simple name of clazz, so initial characters match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.756658962Z"}
{"id":"c3891eb7-26d8-43ff-92bb-5b266f372bec","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Even if the class name is empty, the short name string is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758322724Z"}
{"id":"0d2d25f2-6ed0-42b1-91ac-d995f9b85b2e","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Class short name cannot be empty string because of Java naming conventions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758322724Z"}
{"id":"f9a91b54-47e6-47bb-8912-c4bb93d83c05","expr":"!(result.contains(\".\"))","rationale":"The short name of a class does not include package information, so it does not include dots.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758322724Z"}
{"id":"f4faed91-6dc7-4d39-bd73-ecf3d827fc8b","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName().equals(result)","rationale":"Get short name returns the simple name of clazz, so it's equal to clazz.getSimpleName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758322724Z"}
{"id":"991111d8-1e64-4600-b2c1-043532e591ba","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz is not null at the start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758815893Z"}
{"id":"96545bb4-3948-40a5-aa3d-1007aff8f9fc","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() always returns a non-null fully qualified name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758815893Z"}
{"id":"e34c4a83-d649-4040-9109-0cb3a2b38229","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false || clazz.getComponentType() != null","rationale":"If the class represents an array, getComponentType is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758815893Z"}
{"id":"fcd8c30f-d320-42cd-bc1f-53c992d4c75d","expr":"clazz.getPackage() == null || clazz.getPackage().getName() != null","rationale":"If the class has a package, that package's name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758815893Z"}
{"id":"6f4dd9da-9a80-4604-a604-09c4e41bcf8a","expr":"clazz.getName().contains(\".\") || clazz.getPackage() == null","rationale":"If class name has a dot, it implies presence of package information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.758815893Z"}
{"id":"179f7cfc-53d5-4b3b-ab38-fa3b7838c701","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method ultimately returns a processed string from getShortName(clazz) and StringUtils.uncapitalizeAsProperty, so result is expected to be a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.764329613Z"}
{"id":"886362f9-71c0-4be7-9104-7c3cdf91dcd9","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method extracts a short class name substring and then uncapitalizes it as a property, the result should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.764329613Z"}
{"id":"79cb7e04-80ff-45d1-a295-e24f29113b6a","expr":"result.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The result is derived by extracting substring after the last package separator ('.'), so it should not contain the package separator character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.764329613Z"}
{"id":"85366bb6-998f-4359-aa4b-6aa851e7d201","expr":"result != null","rationale":"By the logic of getPackageName delegation method, the returned package name string is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.766102541Z"}
{"id":"42fdbd14-c00a-4808-9182-8045f8a8221e","expr":"result.isEmpty() || clazz.getName().startsWith(result)","rationale":"The package name returned by getPackageName is either empty string or a prefix of the full class name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.766102541Z"}
{"id":"dfa01786-2a43-4f7b-9f58-d95f0dee964d","expr":"result.indexOf('.') == -1 || result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"This is tautological but expresses a property that package names either have no dot or contain at least one dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.766102541Z"}
{"id":"84396b0a-a513-4fd0-80bd-d8e2be302f6d","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || !clazz.getName().contains(\".\")","rationale":"Empty package name means the class is in the default package (class name has no dot).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.766102541Z"}
{"id":"bed5b05e-7155-43fd-8cc2-dc76d6fb78dc","expr":"fqClassName != null","rationale":"Method asserts fqClassName must not be null, so this holds before method execution.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.779973375Z"}
{"id":"aeb80bff-c0ff-44ff-8906-b29d8aefe57f","expr":"fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"To compute package name, we rely on position of '.', so invariant reflects its presence or absence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.779973375Z"}
{"id":"e929eb1b-7448-4c2d-874d-c392038eb3a6","expr":"fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') <= fqClassName.length() - 1","rationale":"Ensures lastIndexOf('.') result is within valid string index range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.779973375Z"}
{"id":"555cc942-449e-4532-9775-1e65ce64eb19","expr":"fqClassName.length() > 0","rationale":"The fqClassName should not be empty string for package extraction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.779973375Z"}
{"id":"55d54507-6f89-454e-8a2f-64cdafd1a7ed","expr":"(!fqClassName.contains(\".\") || fqClassName.indexOf('.') >= 0)","rationale":"This combined condition holds for any string about '.' presence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.779973375Z"}
{"id":"b4cd1c0d-0db1-408b-82fd-2d96b9cb320b","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The code calls Assert.notNull(clazz), so clazz must not be null here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.781234469Z"}
{"id":"a5cebb90-3a5b-4fbc-b857-928ad576dccb","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() returns a non-null fully qualified name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.781234469Z"}
{"id":"7f9ee780-766d-41fa-8533-2e7b1027755a","expr":"clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"The last dot index may be -1 if there's no package.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.781234469Z"}
{"id":"363a826f-3cdc-4fe3-9b9d-cf85e8e01050","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class names are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.781234469Z"}
{"id":"d621e3ae-305b-44ba-bc96-07d815e61af9","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false || clazz.getName().startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"If clazz represents an array, its name starts with '['.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.781234469Z"}
{"id":"bc2a2f94-4bfd-4fb0-a5d8-4a361671b750","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz is not null at the entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.787607718Z"}
{"id":"4b753ae2-9c96-4535-ba91-2bb9a8c72aab","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().equals(clazz.getName())","rationale":"The canonical name, if non-null, should be a standardized version relating to the class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.787607718Z"}
{"id":"bb854d18-3dd7-49e1-8401-a30cd5540680","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().contains(\".\")","rationale":"Canonical names for classes are fully qualified and generally contain package delimiters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.787607718Z"}
{"id":"ee25f45d-94ad-4e96-9aab-28cae11c4a74","expr":"clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"getTypeName() should return a non-null type name for any class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.787607718Z"}
{"id":"a0563e00-8dc2-4421-aebe-036145160bd6","expr":"(!(clazz.getCanonicalName() == null) || (clazz.getTypeName() != null))","rationale":"Either the canonical name is present or the type name is non-null, so a name is always available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.787607718Z"}
{"id":"4c16907f-ca8a-4e43-818e-ca8956100449","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns either the canonical name or the type name, both guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.788491612Z"}
{"id":"90cfda45-c916-4592-83a5-431c275b3129","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName()) || result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"Based on the implementation, result is equal to canonicalName if not null; otherwise typeName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.788491612Z"}
{"id":"8bc9a52e-6a03-4e4c-b7bf-5b78333a454a","expr":"(clazz.getCanonicalName() != null) == result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName())","rationale":"If canonicalName is non-null, result equals it; else result equals typeName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.788491612Z"}
{"id":"bd836bd2-f4b4-4315-8a9b-c0528b9b8ed4","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Both canonicalName and typeName representations are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.788491612Z"}
{"id":"e2bbab18-ce74-4756-a8d0-b8111daa848b","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"The method returns clazz.getTypeName(), so result should be equal to that.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.793442964Z"}
{"id":"1a93eb7a-1407-4f7b-ab85-ccbf900a2ffb","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null for getQualifiedMethodName to operate.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:53.795546975Z"}
