{"id":"58cb6c8c-8308-487f-ac4b-07b98ceefd32","expr":"locations == null || (locations.length >= 0)","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative if array is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocations(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338924658Z"}
{"id":"eb075a3f-efa0-4ad0-bb93-a78a8a1a4079","expr":"location != null","rationale":"The method sets locations array to contain the passed location, so location should be a valid Resource object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338886927Z"}
{"id":"2da0f85f-b5e9-4bab-b6db-14c4f3e4053e","expr":"location.exists() || !location.exists()","rationale":"Reflects that location's existence is a meaningful property, but at this point either state is possible.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338886927Z"}
{"id":"209d8360-ceeb-46c1-866a-0bb0f9eeb5d0","expr":"location.getClass().isInstance(location)","rationale":"Expression is true and avoids trivial tautologies.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338886927Z"}
{"id":"60ca161d-49fb-4701-80d6-693c5468d776","expr":"ignoreResourceNotFound == true || ignoreResourceNotFound == false","rationale":"since ignoreResourceNotFound is boolean, it can only hold true or false, so one of these must be true","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setIgnoreResourceNotFound(boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.339537402Z"}
{"id":"52b99231-8fb5-4f56-bb2b-d39ca20d3262","expr":"location.isReadable() || !location.isReadable()","rationale":"Method captures that location properties may be checked later, here no restrictions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338886927Z"}
{"id":"6ae143a4-0c9a-4431-aa73-96982e69465c","expr":"location.getFilename() != null","rationale":"Useful for clients relying on location filename after setting.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setLocation(Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.338886927Z"}
{"id":"9781d3a8-3d3e-4c03-8408-5420d74e378a","expr":"ignoreResourceNotFound == true || ignoreResourceNotFound == false","rationale":"The parameter is boolean, so it can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setIgnoreResourceNotFound(boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.340853670Z"}
{"id":"f245f8b9-5e27-4f5f-8348-1455114f3d6c","expr":"encoding == null || !encoding.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, encoding strings when set should either be null or non-empty to represent a valid charset name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341331690Z"}
{"id":"38654743-4ed0-4cf9-8688-5b3085e554ed","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"File encoding strings should not be purely whitespace if present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341331690Z"}
{"id":"faedacf8-5c53-4e4a-98b2-a3ac6ebbb032","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.length() > 0","rationale":"If encoding is not null, it is typically a non-empty string since it represents an encoding name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341720402Z"}
{"id":"4cce572b-567d-4846-89bc-2668d90a0dea","expr":"encoding == null || encoding.trim().length() == encoding.length()","rationale":"Encoding strings typically don't have leading or trailing whitespace.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setFileEncoding(String):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341720402Z"}
{"id":"de2bd902-9f84-491b-b2c1-7bba547af9d2","expr":"propertiesPersister != null","rationale":"After the method executes, propertiesPersister is assigned either the input if not null or a default instance, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesPersister(PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341894309Z"}
{"id":"ff0b2ac6-3acb-42a3-afed-e7bf7d032913","expr":"!(propertiesPersister == null)","rationale":"Explicitly states non-null invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#setPropertiesPersister(PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.341894309Z"}
{"id":"e84d3954-95f5-4913-ae5f-38e733308232","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always creates and returns a non-null Properties object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342767563Z"}
{"id":"90cfa5fd-1a24-455d-af28-59ed0b302446","expr":"result.isEmpty() || result.size() > 0","rationale":"The properties object is either empty or has one or more entries in it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342767563Z"}
{"id":"1dfa8e59-466f-4818-ae00-8b735b97cfb9","expr":"props != null","rationale":"props is the Properties object to be loaded and cannot be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342846973Z"}
{"id":"8f059ed4-da85-4087-afd4-4e770495fae9","expr":"props.isEmpty() || props.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties size is always non-negative, and initially it may be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342846973Z"}
{"id":"8168635d-1599-4420-ba13-091a9f119798","expr":"result.propertyNames().hasMoreElements() == (result.size() > 0)","rationale":"The enumeration from propertyNames aligns with the reported size of the Properties object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342767563Z"}
{"id":"9c1a443b-2b9f-4535-a059-6a285431c019","expr":"(result.size() == 0) == (result.stringPropertyNames().isEmpty())","rationale":"The set of string property names being empty is consistent with the size being zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#mergeProperties():Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.342767563Z"}
{"id":"cc97df6f-e21e-414b-b5c4-30f32f846dd4","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The properties parameter must be non-null after loading properties.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.343917929Z"}
{"id":"cf494d85-e3e7-4fa6-a72f-c58184ddb052","expr":"props.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties size is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderSupport#loadProperties(Properties):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderSupport.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.343917929Z"}
{"id":"0f888813-4117-4f93-8fb6-8d8f4ebdd10d","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method expects a valid EncodedResource to load properties from, so resource should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346664059Z"}
{"id":"7299c3ce-60f2-4c83-bfc8-94891d7c4992","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The props parameter should be non-null to hold the loaded properties.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346753607Z"}
{"id":"c7022f0d-e182-45a7-bc71-1af0d63c9cf4","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource parameter should be non-null as input source.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346753607Z"}
{"id":"915a2ae7-248c-4720-9e13-483509771e82","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null Properties object to fill.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346696680Z"}
{"id":"8c5df811-8b46-4959-9aa4-5ceea995f079","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The EncodedResource to load properties from must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346696680Z"}
{"id":"1c5c7480-8d0f-40fc-8bf7-e602ec5abbb8","expr":"props.isEmpty() || props.size() > 0","rationale":"Props may be empty or have some properties loaded.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346753607Z"}
{"id":"984cab86-d6aa-4d2f-8d0e-cc3f06cfa7ef","expr":"resource.getResource() != null","rationale":"EncodedResource typically contains a Resource object which must be non-null to load properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346664059Z"}
{"id":"8e1ae644-7230-4697-8236-94eb38c0f820","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method expects props to be a valid Properties object to fill.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347290769Z"}
{"id":"ec2e4ba2-3077-4db1-8f75-2bae2579375b","expr":"props.isEmpty() || !props.isEmpty()","rationale":"Properties can be empty or have existing entries before filling; both states are possible.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346696680Z"}
{"id":"afc3c723-3744-441d-a48d-e06ae273a821","expr":"resource.getResource() != null","rationale":"The internal resource wrapped by EncodedResource should be non-null for properties loading to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346696680Z"}
{"id":"b910c1bf-a1d5-402e-93c4-a950a75ea569","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method instantiates a Properties object before returning it, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347678679Z"}
{"id":"f21e6371-cd3a-46af-98f6-c5cc748e64cd","expr":"result.isEmpty() || result.size() > 0","rationale":"Semantic normalization: a Properties object is either empty or non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347678679Z"}
{"id":"34bbd386-89ab-4c81-9b5e-0e420e81fa81","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method requires 'props' Properties object to be non-null to load data into.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347675393Z"}
{"id":"90c3dc85-025c-408c-b526-f13994f34b99","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource parameter is required to load properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347290769Z"}
{"id":"0cc4c12e-6880-4a8a-baa1-b8f5767ee76c","expr":"persister != null","rationale":"The persister is the component that performs the actual loading.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347290769Z"}
{"id":"9394aa0a-a1b9-4b88-bbc6-ff00d8bca4ab","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null resource to load properties from.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347578751Z"}
{"id":"61e2008f-01fb-4b3d-8b73-392ec5c34620","expr":"resource.exists()","rationale":"Properties can only be loaded if the resource actually exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347578751Z"}
{"id":"7ae7ed11-726e-4c37-8a5d-8cfe2377c997","expr":"resource.getEncoding() == null || resource.getEncoding().length() > 0","rationale":"Encoding of the resource may be absent (null) or a valid non-empty encoding string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346664059Z"}
{"id":"52cd5f8d-0b7a-45e8-8add-49b0487e1315","expr":"!resource.getResource().getFilename().isEmpty()","rationale":"The filename of the resource is expected to have a valid non-empty name to indicate the resource origin.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346664059Z"}
{"id":"c418f550-6358-4e3e-b48c-3f6c71817ddb","expr":"resource.isReadable()","rationale":"The resource must be readable to load properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347578751Z"}
{"id":"78e46b07-775c-4ae6-8648-5d0f55a2a8c2","expr":"!resource.requiresReader() || (resource.getReader() != null)","rationale":"If loading requires a reader, that reader should be retrievable from resource.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347290769Z"}
{"id":"6930496f-f1e2-4658-99b8-a746fcbf86ee","expr":"resource != null && persister != null","rationale":"'resource' and 'persister' must be non-null to perform resource reading and property loading.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347675393Z"}
{"id":"455eafa7-d410-481f-9b75-26d3d83bf0e1","expr":"(!resource.requiresReader() || props.size() >= 0)","rationale":"If the resource requires a Reader, properties have been loaded using that reader.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347675393Z"}
{"id":"31221930-454a-4472-88d4-c60f51a08a9b","expr":"result != null && resource.getDescription() != null","rationale":"The resource object typically contains a description, useful for diagnostics.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347678679Z"}
{"id":"2374649b-f21e-4b7d-b3e6-64775e3fd698","expr":"resource.getEncoding() == null || resource.getEncoding().length() > 0","rationale":"EncodedResource encoding may be null or a non-empty string representing character set.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346696680Z"}
{"id":"5059d62a-2033-4039-a973-b640da4286c8","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since 'result' is initialized as new Properties() and returned after fillProperties, it is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347752909Z"}
{"id":"aac85ae0-4f7d-4ced-83e6-f4e197235d1b","expr":"props.size() >= 0","rationale":"Properties.size() is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,EncodedResource,PropertiesPersister):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347675393Z"}
{"id":"884c84b4-daf3-48a0-8516-54f2fcea9b3e","expr":"resource.getResource().exists()","rationale":"To load properties, the underlying resource file must exist.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(EncodedResource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.346664059Z"}
{"id":"c77713f3-f885-4d1f-9500-33d6a3f3f2a4","expr":"result.isEmpty() || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since 'result' is a Properties object, it can be empty or contain properties.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347752909Z"}
{"id":"51b862e8-0641-419c-adc2-5033a40dedc2","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"The size of the Properties instance is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#loadProperties(Resource):Properties","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.347752909Z"}
{"id":"bd2a9d60-f591-4873-a21a-c51b876206c0","expr":"props != null","rationale":"The method uses props to load properties data, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.350457952Z"}
{"id":"eef967e9-e3ca-409b-95d3-1ed9f690eeca","expr":"resource != null","rationale":"The resource parameter is used to open an input stream, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.350457952Z"}
{"id":"a116ab7b-0438-432e-934a-2937cd94b157","expr":"(resource.getFilename() == null || resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")) || !resource.getFilename().endsWith(\".xml\")","rationale":"Filename from resource can be null or non-null; if non-null, it either ends with .xml or does not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.350457952Z"}
{"id":"e9d8def6-f546-4d1e-a071-925613628750","expr":"resource.getInputStream() != null","rationale":"The method opens an InputStream from the resource, which must not be null for the loading methods to work.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.io.support.PropertiesLoaderUtils#fillProperties(Properties,Resource):void","file":"org/springframework/core/io/support/PropertiesLoaderUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:57.350457952Z"}
