{"id":"b247cf3a-136d-4406-be12-d8ffd382c48d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method throws an exception if the property is not found, so any returned result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getRequiredProperty(String,Class<T>):T","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.971572893Z"}
