{"id":"538f3b9f-4f58-4eb8-ade8-309d612a9736","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Typically, the placeholder resolution returns a non-null string, either modified or original.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolvePlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.972981485Z"}
{"id":"68592800-1077-42e1-9ce1-6b2d499152b5","expr":"text != null","rationale":"The parameter text must be non-null for placeholder resolution to proceed safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveRequiredPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.973482969Z"}
{"id":"18bb468c-cf9d-4ebc-a171-045d67df9224","expr":"text.length() > 0","rationale":"If the method is invoked, text usually should be non-empty to contain placeholders.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveRequiredPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.973482969Z"}
