{"id":"4fd58f1d-da3a-4f98-b150-41af470784d7","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Since this is a required property, the value retrieved is expected to be meaningful and non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#getRequiredProperty(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.967749504Z"}
