{"id":"54641b23-1302-49c5-94b7-4ad61362298e","expr":"!value.isEmpty() || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input value is empty, method returns value unchanged, so result should be empty also.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveNestedPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.975186546Z"}
{"id":"780d36b8-9c00-477a-8455-f074ca1db851","expr":"(!value.isEmpty()) || result == value","rationale":"Specifically, when value is empty, result equals value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveNestedPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.975186546Z"}
{"id":"8654c6d4-216c-47a7-ab34-1e7818d6cd30","expr":"ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders == true || ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders == false","rationale":"The parameter ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders is of boolean type, so it can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#createPlaceholderHelper(boolean):PropertyPlaceholderHelper","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.977199846Z"}
{"id":"c1620b11-fe9f-486e-8439-4d90493046c0","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always creates and returns a new PropertyPlaceholderHelper instance; thus, result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#createPlaceholderHelper(boolean):PropertyPlaceholderHelper","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978339281Z"}
{"id":"8d80a361-2067-460b-b5d3-014682242ccf","expr":"result.getIgnoreUnresolvablePlaceholders() == ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders","rationale":"The created PropertyPlaceholderHelper's ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders property reflects the method parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#createPlaceholderHelper(boolean):PropertyPlaceholderHelper","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978339281Z"}
{"id":"e518599a-d26e-4a24-b037-6dee72b42e82","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a resolved string with placeholders replaced, so result is unlikely to be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveRequiredPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.973676233Z"}
{"id":"2500bf3a-4461-43f0-b397-558d5a9325f0","expr":"result.length() >= 0","rationale":"Because result is a String, and String.length() is non-negative, this is always true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveRequiredPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.973676233Z"}
{"id":"a73cbce4-4cce-4ab7-8d9d-a3436b7c2a1a","expr":"result.equals(text) || !result.equals(text)","rationale":"This is logically always true, thus no inclusion","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#resolveRequiredPlaceholders(String):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.973676233Z"}
{"id":"145b2443-1f29-46de-ab39-4913e16c1530","expr":"text != null","rationale":"Since the method replaces placeholders in the provided text, the text should be a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978872425Z"}
{"id":"357fbbf2-0f5b-4962-9c66-d680f672745c","expr":"helper != null","rationale":"The helper parameter is used to execute the replacement; thus it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978872425Z"}
{"id":"cd8c8c49-608e-4baf-a32b-d07a79a43e77","expr":"helper.supportsPlaceholders()","rationale":"The helper is expected to be capable of replacing placeholders, so it should support them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978872425Z"}
{"id":"bf0217ec-4638-4cf1-b279-b0a925664ce4","expr":"text.length() >= 0","rationale":"Text length is inherently non-negative and might be relevant for understanding the input size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.core.env.AbstractPropertyResolver#doResolvePlaceholders(String,PropertyPlaceholderHelper):String","file":"org/springframework/core/env/AbstractPropertyResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:37:58.978872425Z"}
