{"id":"44020677-d8d2-446f-8142-8f903854760c","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method is creating write methods for fields identified by non-null names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.492791392Z"}
{"id":"629b87c8-7612-4b79-bf5b-fb104a62dc7a","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method is invoked with a Type instance representing the field's type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.492791392Z"}
{"id":"fd569c1b-8c6e-4130-b2d7-636bcdc013fb","expr":"type.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The method uses type descriptor string to construct method signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#addWriteMethod(String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.492791392Z"}
{"id":"842ff6d2-87fe-4ef0-882f-1967345a189c","expr":"sig != null","rationale":"The 'sig' parameter represents the method signature; typically it should not be null because the method requires method signature metadata to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494141363Z"}
{"id":"6bfc0574-43b4-4265-801a-cc2e0e59819e","expr":"exceptions != null","rationale":"The 'exceptions' parameter holds the list of exception types the method might throw; usually this is non-null, although it might be an empty array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494141363Z"}
{"id":"fe26683a-aac8-4963-a666-683c41ec318e","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The 'access' integer represents method access flags and modifiers. These flags are bits in a non-negative integer mask, so this is expected to be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494141363Z"}
{"id":"504f187d-71b9-4ea0-bf05-87273f1e751b","expr":"exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"'exceptions' is an array; its length is zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494141363Z"}
{"id":"af0a0e6c-f9af-48b2-868e-872fcd0131db","expr":"sig.getArgumentTypes() != null","rationale":"The Signature object usually provides non-null argument types array to represent the method's parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494141363Z"}
{"id":"4fd0cca4-3ee7-4895-b32a-b9ba4194b353","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method constructs and returns a new CodeEmitter object wrapping the super begin_method call, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#begin_method(int,Signature,Type[]):CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.494978930Z"}
{"id":"9faad276-ae08-46e3-8682-3819a89415c5","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method concatenates name with a string; hence name should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.497990079Z"}
{"id":"d2689f67-f8a1-4d86-ad2b-25f23ba0226f","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method concatenates desc with another string forming a signature descriptor, so desc should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.497990079Z"}
{"id":"1509ab31-582c-4d5f-ad8c-ba102438941c","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"A method name is normally not empty; concatenating with a prefix suggests name is a meaningful identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.497990079Z"}
{"id":"60beb1b1-be13-41cc-97c9-ad92d7fb2ea2","expr":"desc.length() >= 0","rationale":"The descriptor string is passed into the signature and could be empty but never negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.497990079Z"}
{"id":"2708b0c8-5bcb-48d6-aa08-4e33f931a6eb","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new Signature instance thus result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.498533883Z"}
{"id":"06763d7d-331c-4221-8b56-aa867b8ed68c","expr":"result.getDescriptor().equals(\"()\" + desc)","rationale":"The result signature descriptor is \"()\" + desc.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.498533883Z"}
{"id":"1bd90544-0a8c-41fb-b7bf-8d5773cd2de7","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a new Signature object constructed with the given name and desc, the result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.500489014Z"}
{"id":"59af2875-1cd0-4c55-a395-4ff98b295064","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method concatenates name to create a new method signature string, so name must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.501130371Z"}
{"id":"61dc1a21-2f78-46e9-b224-887022f0a4a4","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method appends desc inside parentheses as part of the signature; desc cannot be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.501130371Z"}
{"id":"276743a2-aa00-4f22-9de4-4a44b693ea81","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"Since the method constructs a signature with the name embedded, a non-empty name string is likely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeMethodSig(String,String):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.501130371Z"}
{"id":"3adf2080-1682-4c96-bc4f-843eb2bd9813","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The parameter 'type' is used as an input to the remap function, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.501805362Z"}
{"id":"bcd89687-9cfb-4c45-b278-404316686796","expr":"result.getReturnType().equals(result.getArgumentTypes()[2])","rationale":"According to the method, the return type is remap and the third argument in the signature array is remap.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#readCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.502246443Z"}
