{"id":"393c818c-fd38-4df6-b6af-121befb9fc71","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The input type parameter should not be null when the method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.502418947Z"}
{"id":"a5a46db4-447b-4c49-8a6c-d4f69d806d4d","expr":"result.getArgumentTypes().length == 4","rationale":"The method constructs a Signature with 4 argument types, so the length of argument types array is 4.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#writeCallbackSig(Type):Signature","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.503202643Z"}
{"id":"3c4f9d62-f329-4fd5-89c4-28eaac83208e","expr":"type != null","rationale":"Type parameter should be non-null for method to operate correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#remap(Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.503883394Z"}
{"id":"f56954f4-e727-4457-a3e0-833bd96126d0","expr":"type.getSort() >= 0","rationale":"Type.getSort() method returns a sort value that indicates the kind of type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#remap(Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.503883394Z"}
{"id":"a2c5870c-e5dc-4e11-bd6a-e5828d6c9dc7","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns either Constants.TYPE_OBJECT or the original type, result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#remap(Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.504336698Z"}
{"id":"e3fa68eb-00ce-484a-9950-430974ef060d","expr":"className != null","rationale":"className typically must be non-null to identify the class in bytecode manipulation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505677011Z"}
{"id":"b6cf9836-fd83-4202-b125-cffff620228f","expr":"className != null","rationale":"The className parameter typically represents the name of the class being defined and is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505706687Z"}
{"id":"3c1c2848-598c-4059-981d-0411f1ebf643","expr":"version > 0","rationale":"The version parameter indicates class file version and should be a positive integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505706687Z"}
{"id":"e050720f-357e-49db-bbd1-44e1b15af7b2","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags represent bitmask values for class modifiers, generally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505706687Z"}
{"id":"4652acd8-7e49-4301-8cf4-ab513a210e02","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces parameter holds the implemented interfaces array and at this stage should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505706687Z"}
{"id":"c48b538e-a4dd-4765-94b3-b0f8daebca10","expr":"superType != null","rationale":"For non-interface classes, superType is typically non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505677011Z"}
{"id":"b1a73553-2dfd-4da7-b154-99e08e64a6be","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces array should be initialized even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505677011Z"}
{"id":"2ab40884-440d-4f67-8dd8-fd8c0fb16267","expr":"(access & 512) != 0 || (access & 1024) == 0","rationale":"Access flags have known patterns that can sometimes be inferred.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505677011Z"}
{"id":"35ba715f-aeed-4c1e-b6d6-24db7216ea85","expr":"sourceFile == null || sourceFile.length() > 0","rationale":"sourceFile may be null or a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.505677011Z"}
{"id":"ec3582c5-2307-4e38-84ea-495c7b6a2d85","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter is required and used for generating getter/setter method names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AccessFieldTransformer#declare_field(int,String,Type,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AccessFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.508916220Z"}
