{"id":"6f62a624-1cfb-4631-9382-927c25f9e9c1","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method uses 'type' in calls, so it must be non-null for those calls to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.InterceptFieldTransformer#callbackName(Type):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/InterceptFieldTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.509154228Z"}
