{"id":"78708071-6782-468a-9ca0-26b8309207e3","expr":"(interfaces != null) && (interfaces.length >= 0)","rationale":"interfaces array must not be null and can be empty","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537497128Z"}
{"id":"a6c5b652-6075-4505-91a4-e1a38886ec68","expr":"(superName == null) || (superName.length() > 0)","rationale":"superName is either null (for java.lang.Object) or a valid class name","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537497128Z"}
{"id":"36032aa9-8a9a-4eca-91b1-5686862d9037","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Class names are usually non-null strings in visit calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537596104Z"}
{"id":"226c9da7-a60a-4999-a80b-01ec9a0ec0c6","expr":"superName == null || !superName.equals(name)","rationale":"Avoids the class being its own superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537596104Z"}
{"id":"5191c9e9-3669-43d6-8a25-cb3bd11ca444","expr":"interfaces != null","rationale":"Interfaces array should be non-null in visit calls, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537596104Z"}
{"id":"9d834e60-c356-4e5b-a663-4b5457ac52ff","expr":"version >= 0","rationale":"Class file version numbers are expected to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537596104Z"}
{"id":"23a4c49f-abd2-4dc1-b1bd-b3cbc88b17b0","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.537596104Z"}
{"id":"5f35f98e-fcc4-4262-ac41-b003213b29e2","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name is the inner class name and should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538265715Z"}
{"id":"ccb7fe6b-4094-4816-90e5-82ef46f5410d","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"access is an integer representing access flags, non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538265715Z"}
{"id":"c761ff8c-867c-46d0-ab60-d2c2dc8a88c6","expr":"(innerName == null) || innerName.equals(name)","rationale":"innerName if present usually corresponds to name or can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538265715Z"}
{"id":"b10af388-8d07-406b-bde5-9f46682445fe","expr":"(outerName == null) || (!outerName.isEmpty())","rationale":"outerName is often either null or a non-empty string representing enclosing class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538265715Z"}
{"id":"357865d4-e0d3-4d5d-be3e-c16fae56e93a","expr":"name != null && outerName != null && innerName != null","rationale":"Ensures that all name parameters refer to valid strings describing class names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538582371Z"}
{"id":"73b879f0-3c03-4e90-950b-2995d667b808","expr":"innerName.length() <= name.length()","rationale":"Reflects typical naming conventions for inner classes where innerName is a substring or suffix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538582371Z"}
{"id":"64c68716-2a3e-42a9-9da7-311689b6d53a","expr":"outerName != null && name.startsWith(outerName)","rationale":"Indicates relationship between inner and outer classes by string prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538582371Z"}
{"id":"0d2fc84b-c39a-4ec3-9816-db8a9a6b74d1","expr":"(access & 0x0001) == 0 || (access & 0x0002) == 0 || (access & 0x0004) == 0","rationale":"The access flags may follow standard Java modifiers that are mutually exclusive or independently set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538582371Z"}
{"id":"9d938c8c-d431-4d9f-8223-b2a77131bf9c","expr":"name.equals(innerName) || innerName.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Captures common characteristic signatures of inner class names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538582371Z"}
{"id":"64a0d179-4921-4fa3-a3cf-4fff4f9d4599","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The inner class name name must be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.538265715Z"}
{"id":"5ca69eeb-d009-477d-97cc-99a321a9b720","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name is expected to be a valid identifier, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.539079767Z"}
{"id":"21d7a51e-ffbf-4c0f-904f-571126d2fac8","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor describes the field type, it should be non-null for valid operation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.539079767Z"}
{"id":"4f8fd1d3-39ab-4d48-b86d-dc1ce5f60907","expr":"(value == null) || true","rationale":"The value parameter is an Object and can be null or any object instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.539079767Z"}
{"id":"1dd687ab-2010-4e95-875c-b8dfa7f351fb","expr":"(access & 0xFFFF) == access","rationale":"Access flags are usually contained within lower bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.539079767Z"}
{"id":"1cb31218-2b3f-42de-9b67-b2e663c9ee8d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the code, if both fv1 and fv2 are non-null, a new FieldVisitorTee is returned, which is non-null; if one is null, the other (non-null) is returned; so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.539685267Z"}
{"id":"5107a85d-6593-4f2b-a516-022390887c61","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name is expected to be a valid string representing the method identifier.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540437013Z"}
{"id":"16e113de-be6b-4949-8e19-c00dff6d8d09","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor encodes the method's parameters and return type and is expected to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540437013Z"}
{"id":"b53f4967-0d4f-41fc-bb1f-1eea6c14ffe6","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"Signature is optional and may be null, but if present, it is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540437013Z"}
{"id":"9526d170-d3a3-459f-8828-c7522d736112","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions parameter may be null or an array representing exceptions thrown by the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540437013Z"}
{"id":"06714500-db32-4579-8bad-d7b3c1e5f294","expr":"result != null","rationale":"When either mv1 or mv2 is non-null, result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540611842Z"}
{"id":"3bdc27b7-8978-47f7-ab47-a4856e0e9483","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"If source is not null, it has a non-negative length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540897159Z"}
{"id":"088987d6-f0fc-4312-87a8-0138765840d8","expr":"debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"If debug is not null, it has a non-negative length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540897159Z"}
{"id":"05d63654-e6cf-4611-9693-ea8e2cde5d0f","expr":"source != null || debug == null","rationale":"There is no direct dependence between source and debug's nullness","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.540897159Z"}
{"id":"f2782ab4-e88d-4dde-a3cb-0ff66dbcb687","expr":"source == null || debug == null || debug.length() >= 0","rationale":"The debug string can be null or non-null. If non-null, its length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.541567711Z"}
{"id":"92d13c56-3f6d-48c5-b608-51e8ee42af2c","expr":"source == null || source.length() >= 0","rationale":"The source string length is non-negative when source is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.541567711Z"}
{"id":"6b617243-030e-4df6-b6e3-edb08958fbaa","expr":"(source == null) || (debug == null) || true","rationale":"No strong logical relation between source and debug can be derived here, but both can be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.541567711Z"}
{"id":"7d071f76-019a-4af3-91fb-da2e6fd7c947","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Since owner identifies a class, it is expected to be non-null when visiting outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542427961Z"}
{"id":"1e526773-c8f4-4bd2-80b6-02fa5c3aaecd","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() > 0)","rationale":"Outer class method name may be null, or if present, should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542427961Z"}
{"id":"6a5df561-c1e6-41af-8cc0-70760571bf51","expr":"(desc == null) || (desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"Descriptor may be null or a valid non-empty string describing method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542427961Z"}
{"id":"f79a3b01-337d-4c16-bccd-9350f14c7caf","expr":"(name != null) || (desc == null)","rationale":"name and desc represent method name and signature; if descriptor is present, method name should be too.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542427961Z"}
{"id":"a60aded7-6228-47f2-a3e1-590140712ab4","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"owner identifies a class name and should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542427961Z"}
{"id":"2fcf3557-5adc-4b1b-b0b1-9e7268475dea","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter must not be null as it is directly used in method calls cv1.visitOuterClass and cv2.visitOuterClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542508342Z"}
{"id":"cf37ecc2-d195-4652-9155-2abf72aa90bb","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Similarly, 'name' should not be null because it is used as a parameter in the invoked methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542508342Z"}
{"id":"128eedb0-c9d5-485a-ad3f-fc8243ae5db3","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' string parameter is also used without null checks, implying it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542508342Z"}
{"id":"f65539a1-fb99-422c-9db7-2fac79ca87dc","expr":"owner.length() > 0","rationale":"Typically, the 'owner' string in ASM or similar bytecode libraries represents a class name and is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542508342Z"}
{"id":"b64e3fbc-fa89-44c9-b39b-7dca27983df5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns the result of AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance(...) which likely never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542937861Z"}
{"id":"7fee5f05-9a8d-4262-8ef1-93ed96909f1e","expr":"!(result == null && desc != null)","rationale":"If desc is not null, then result should not be null since the annotations are being visited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542937861Z"}
{"id":"25378311-0ec7-4745-8475-ee9c12953a29","expr":"!visible || result != null","rationale":"If the annotation is visible, the returned AnnotationVisitor should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542937861Z"}
{"id":"4cc14fc2-4898-47a8-93ce-c38a5c6c5bf6","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is expected to be a valid type descriptor or annotation description string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542766318Z"}
{"id":"8b1626a5-18b7-40d2-96f4-8714c2bd8750","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptors are non-empty strings indicating annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542766318Z"}
{"id":"613a9ac7-46aa-47b2-ab8f-d0b6e2509f23","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a method parameter of type boolean, so it is always boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542766318Z"}
{"id":"9f98055c-e364-4d97-aca9-004a73ede3d6","expr":"attrs != null","rationale":"The method visitAttribute is called with attrs, so attrs is expected not to be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.543748407Z"}
{"id":"0feaafc1-ba31-4d31-a7fe-284d7fdd7237","expr":"!attrs.isEmpty()","rationale":"If Attribute provides an isEmpty() method, the attribute being visited is typically non-empty, but this depends on available methods which are not guaranteed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.543748407Z"}
{"id":"b512323b-72cb-4952-be34-d823f1c7cf0f","expr":"attrs.toString() != null","rationale":"Typically, toString() returns a non-null string, indicating the attribute can be represented as text.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.543748407Z"}
{"id":"7191d367-a740-44af-b4c5-ac0d807c1c25","expr":"attrs.hashCode() >= 0","rationale":"Hash codes should be consistent and mostly non-negative depending on implementation, giving an invariant to consider.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.543748407Z"}
{"id":"44195c87-f82c-457d-8754-833a10734e9c","expr":"(!name.isEmpty() && !desc.isEmpty()) || (name == null && desc == null)","rationale":"In ASM, usually name and desc are either both provided with meaningful content or both null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassVisitorTee#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.542508342Z"}
{"id":"e2a16009-592c-4a88-ad83-d0432099d1c3","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter is used as a method argument immediately, so it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.FieldVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/FieldVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.544388312Z"}
