{"id":"5b71d5d2-6168-4b59-9d94-0fa6622d044b","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method uses attr as a parameter to another method call without a prior null check, so attr must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.551620267Z"}
