{"id":"f41b9421-c2aa-46e7-9a29-746dfd983338","expr":"(name == null && desc == null) || (name != null && desc != null)","rationale":"Since name and desc represent the method's name and descriptor, they are likely provided together or both omitted.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.550182841Z"}
{"id":"f614df5d-adb2-4c23-ad8a-fb046e3ac947","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null","rationale":"The method delegates to target.visitOuterClass passing these three parameters; likely, none are null when the call occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.550182841Z"}
{"id":"90a7c846-25ef-4c2e-af13-974854db5a7e","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty() && result != null && visible == (visible || !visible)","rationale":"The method delegates visitAnnotation to target, so result corresponds to target's visitAnnotation result which typically expects a non-null desc and returns non-null visitor if annotation is recognized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.551198212Z"}
{"id":"1cd3e129-acc6-474b-b78c-bce5c2c6c82c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"It is likely that visitAnnotation returns a non-null AnnotationVisitor when an annotation matching description is present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.551198212Z"}
{"id":"96b2b8a8-d1e7-4309-b4f5-5aa460a7a5d7","expr":"result != null || !visible","rationale":"Usually, visible controls accessibility of annotations; result might be null for invisible annotations.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.551198212Z"}
{"id":"2ae11677-b068-45cd-9b6c-a9613d157104","expr":"source == null || debug == null || source != null && debug != null","rationale":"This expression tries to suggest that either both are null or both are non-null, capturing a possible relation in usage patterns.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.549734827Z"}
{"id":"9497ce49-96a0-43c2-b721-ee0a5941d77c","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method delegates the call to target.visitAttribute(attr), so attr should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.552058792Z"}
{"id":"0e73a358-ea25-4c4c-a657-e122f4405243","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.552993823Z"}
{"id":"1d2bc4a9-dc13-4ddb-8de1-78a9c419cdaa","expr":"innerName != null","rationale":"innerName is being passed to target.visitInnerClass, so it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.552993823Z"}
{"id":"90c6429f-cbf7-4938-b9bd-c0b69b0f88a5","expr":"(outerName == null) || (outerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"outerName may be null or a non-empty string identifying outer class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.552993823Z"}
