{"id":"c15e1ca1-b436-4ae2-9a72-29c97722ccf2","expr":"!(innerName != null && outerName != null) || !innerName.equals(outerName)","rationale":"If both innerName and outerName are non-null, they should not be equal as inner and outer classes have distinct names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.552993823Z"}
{"id":"b7294468-08ab-460b-a73e-a1b8ad30ac97","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 && !name.contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Typically, inner class names are non-null, non-empty and do not contain the '$' character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.553693781Z"}
{"id":"a1d651f2-e108-421a-933d-7d2b7e098b56","expr":"outerName == null || outerName.length() > 0","rationale":"outerName is either null indicating no outer class or a valid non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.553693781Z"}
{"id":"ac5dae26-ed12-44b8-892c-0ddd96e2f328","expr":"innerName == null || innerName.length() > 0","rationale":"innerName is either null or a non-empty identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.553693781Z"}
{"id":"fc7e3df4-b953-49aa-8c49-cc334f1777b0","expr":"(access & 0x0001) == 0 || (access & 0x0002) == 0 || (access & 0x0004) == 0","rationale":"Access flags commonly include visibility modifiers corresponding to 0x0001, 0x0002, or 0x0004 bits set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.553693781Z"}
{"id":"53e10aa8-f80e-4164-aac3-4f7af1ce3d42","expr":"name.equals(innerName) || outerName == null","rationale":"Ensures that the inner class name differs from the enclosing class unless outerName is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.553693781Z"}
{"id":"61410910-f30f-49fa-b522-baf29890e08c","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The field name parameter is expected to be a valid string to identify the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554205624Z"}
{"id":"65cfe9b8-02e8-4ae8-b048-6d0c87c46a5b","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string should be non-null to specify the type of the field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554205624Z"}
{"id":"7934a953-4973-44ca-8f90-5022aa46065a","expr":"(signature == null || signature.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Signature may be null when not provided; if not null, it should be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554205624Z"}
{"id":"2b5154d3-7816-49c3-9db2-1285f58fddab","expr":"value == null || true","rationale":"The initial value is optional and may be any Object or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554205624Z"}
{"id":"7775f521-cb08-40da-98cd-88fb06f1893c","expr":"(access & ~0xFFFFF) == 0","rationale":"The access modifiers typically use certain bits, this checks for flag mask validity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554205624Z"}
