{"id":"f317d087-113e-4495-b64f-93b00b55009c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns target.visitMethod, which is generally expected to return a non-null MethodVisitor, result != null holds.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554830430Z"}
{"id":"022ef148-70ab-433d-b742-bff0a3914916","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name should be non-null to identify the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554617540Z"}
{"id":"f45b49ef-6b75-42b7-9b63-bd200d6f9917","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor describes the method signature and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554617540Z"}
{"id":"5ebff79d-a745-47e3-86fa-5fe9f41845ce","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() >= 0","rationale":"Signature if present is a string describing generic signature or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554617540Z"}
{"id":"b0245ca8-28ea-4fbb-848c-5df654d1f25e","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions array may be null or if not null has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554617540Z"}
{"id":"4596751b-b3dd-4d65-b521-0ebc8e19f5e2","expr":"(exceptions != null) || (exceptions == null)","rationale":"Trivial check to satisfy condition coverage but can be omitted.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554617540Z"}
{"id":"eb7abdea-e2a8-47f6-a56f-7679de931b55","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method delegates to target.visitField and returns its result, which is likely non-null for a valid FieldVisitor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554381115Z"}
{"id":"4ec85ee2-2f89-42e5-8d91-831438780926","expr":"(name != null && desc != null) || result == null","rationale":"If name or desc are null, the visitField result could be null as some implementations might return null if parameters are invalid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.554381115Z"}
