{"id":"8b7c7e8e-b7a8-4bd1-a5b4-c434ea0142bb","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The input parameter v, representing a ClassVisitor, must be non-null as it is used to set the chain target.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556304305Z"}
{"id":"c53767b2-8c4d-466a-8298-5e8b233809c6","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The parameter v is assigned in the loop and passed to setTarget on chain elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556394535Z"}
