{"id":"a8fb4ca9-c0f4-4df7-9532-99fde0d158af","expr":"result.contains(\", \") == (result.indexOf(\", \") > -1)","rationale":"If the result contains \", \", it implies the chain had multiple elements separated by commas.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#toString():String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556662560Z"}
{"id":"07853192-0c70-4f36-ac84-f20762d3f18b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The delegate visitMethod on cv returns a MethodVisitor which is assigned to result, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556588841Z"}
{"id":"d6cd90fd-0fb2-41df-b5ec-a24b3e608032","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The ClassVisitor parameter v is set as the target for t, so v must be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.TransformingClassGenerator#generateClass(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/TransformingClassGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556795069Z"}
{"id":"d7b21ab3-cb58-4cde-a6de-7e3af70202a3","expr":"name != null","rationale":"A method must have a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556794248Z"}
{"id":"6b786c11-4928-4f62-9756-98ae3aeaa660","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"To describe the method signature, desc must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556794248Z"}
{"id":"f81c62cc-57f3-4ba2-8a70-5714819b122e","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Exceptions array may be null or non-null and non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556794248Z"}
{"id":"8e9e744e-71ea-477c-8f0b-5e3d36605481","expr":"(signature == null) || (signature.length() > 0)","rationale":"Signature is optional; if given, it is not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556794248Z"}
{"id":"4ae0445d-06d1-4e39-950b-f54da6f7d733","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Access flags are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.556794248Z"}
{"id":"93b807ab-c8eb-4301-a84b-aa94be536454","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since visitAnnotationDefault() returns the combined result of two visits, the result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562110166Z"}
{"id":"a32046de-e02f-4522-9a02-3ea1eff94300","expr":"result.visitAnnotationDefault() == null","rationale":"The returned visitor might delegate some calls to underlying visitors, and calling visitAnnotationDefault() on it could return null as is common for certain visitors.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562110166Z"}
{"id":"5b06781d-b4a9-4e4b-8d3f-e1bc9ddfeb97","expr":"result.hashCode() != 0","rationale":"To distinguish instances, the result object should have a stable and non-zero hash code.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotationDefault():AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562110166Z"}
{"id":"8ce7f22c-8118-41b1-bcc6-c0d87dc030ff","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be a valid descriptor string required to create an annotation visitor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562217268Z"}
{"id":"e4e064f4-4593-4d3e-bbb1-3b3482687b80","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean parameter, so this invariant just reflects that it’s boolean.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562217268Z"}
{"id":"71023a02-91d1-47c7-a736-258a563e1b66","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc should be a non-empty string to represent valid annotation descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562217268Z"}
{"id":"acaa55ae-becb-405a-a421-5ba82fc493e9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a combined object from two other visitAnnotation calls, the result is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562178464Z"}
{"id":"0b16df59-7b3b-4be8-a347-6813659adcfd","expr":"!result.equals(null)","rationale":"The result object is expected to be a non-null AnnotationVisitor instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562178464Z"}
{"id":"b8e0a3f2-3a96-4f8a-8599-0b8863512680","expr":"(desc != null) == (result != null)","rationale":"Typically a visitAnnotation call returns non-null only if the description is provided.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562178464Z"}
{"id":"f82fecc2-56b1-4dd5-86d7-e5f12fed9daf","expr":"type >= 0","rationale":"The ASM API defines frame type constants as non-negative integers","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562808070Z"}
