{"id":"20293dc8-e389-4996-a0f2-63cf11e27c8f","expr":"(stack == null) || (stack.length >= nStack)","rationale":"The stack array should have enough entries for the given count of stack elements","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.562808070Z"}
