{"id":"eeaf14ba-eb58-42d2-a9e9-0be78fa5c369","expr":"attr.data != null || attr.length == 0","rationale":"An Attribute with no data might have data as null only if length is zero, otherwise data should be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.567332788Z"}
{"id":"2e61e75e-d6f6-44bd-8367-cd887f60d919","expr":"attr.isCodeAttribute() == false","rationale":"Depending on the attribute, this could be true as common attributes differ; assuming false as typical non-code attribute","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.567332788Z"}
{"id":"12267f33-ee6c-460e-9c5e-268c537d9882","expr":"attr != null","rationale":"The method calls visitAttribute on mv1 and mv2 with attr; attr must not be null for these calls to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.567478613Z"}
{"id":"6a5007be-d497-49be-babe-5ab20e471286","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode likely represents a bytecode instruction, which is usually a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.568803948Z"}
{"id":"94d9239d-cacd-43f8-a0b7-36c778c87996","expr":"opcode <= 255","rationale":"In Java bytecode, opcode is an unsigned byte value between 0 and 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.568803948Z"}
