{"id":"dee92738-c6f8-4807-8560-5727debbc355","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"visitInsn should not receive opcode 0 if it represents a valid instruction call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569107720Z"}
{"id":"a10c83be-98df-4720-8c3a-4953bd41d156","expr":"opcode != 202","rationale":"The opcode should correspond to a valid JVM instruction; 202 is outside known opcode values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569107720Z"}
{"id":"e34f1903-4fa8-4544-bfe6-fc77094bce24","expr":"opcode != 255","rationale":"Opcode 255 is not a recognized JVM opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569107720Z"}
{"id":"2bb1cb85-e211-4709-bd3f-2b38164aa38f","expr":"opcode != -1","rationale":"Opcode values are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsn(int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569107720Z"}
{"id":"2aed2c5b-a930-47ec-a721-bd08404c647a","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents bytecode instructions which are usually non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569793681Z"}
{"id":"d33f8525-cd56-4390-8154-601ba3d81bce","expr":"operand >= 0","rationale":"Operand in visitIntInsn likely to be non-negative as it represents an integer operand.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569793681Z"}
{"id":"ab691f49-779e-48e9-9c2a-c8595de7e634","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcodes for bytecode instructions are generally non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569832485Z"}
{"id":"83727b27-d74a-428e-bff0-0f622258a9bf","expr":"operand >= 0","rationale":"Operands for visitIntInsn usually represent constants or offsets which are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569832485Z"}
{"id":"0e09ef46-e8bb-480a-8cdb-5bbdcb65fd60","expr":"operand <= 65535","rationale":"Operands in ASM bytecode instructions are often limited to 16-bit unsigned values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569832485Z"}
{"id":"7d25596e-fd16-474b-a821-162fbc53c0f8","expr":"opcode != 0 || operand != 0","rationale":"Zero zero opcode and operand might be invalid or indicative of an uninitialized state.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569832485Z"}
{"id":"581264d2-d960-44a3-9d2f-6f61668f6b76","expr":"(opcode == 16) || (opcode == 17) || (opcode == 18) || (opcode == 19) || (opcode == 20)","rationale":"visitIntInsn is called only for certain opcodes within the JVM which typically include BIPUSH (16), SIPUSH (17), etc.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIntInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.569793681Z"}
