{"id":"e44555bf-f427-4f04-b7a8-54c7c9e5b596","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values correspond to bytecode instruction opcodes which are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.572993496Z"}
