{"id":"949c4dc9-eb85-4dcc-87f8-2bf4bd51b34e","expr":"var <= 65535","rationale":"Local variable indices are limited by the JVM's maximum method local variables count, typically up to 65535.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.572993496Z"}
{"id":"61eb5525-a537-461b-9919-e0e3bb233741","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"Variable instructions generally have meaningful opcode values, not nop (0).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.572993496Z"}
{"id":"c37f3f5e-5c8c-4328-867e-54b3f9bb29a5","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode parameter should be a valid JVM opcode which are typically non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573107971Z"}
{"id":"cd963728-be06-4dff-9c38-3a49ef4e71fe","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"The var parameter represents a local variable index which must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573107971Z"}
{"id":"cc500338-2d61-4c7b-bc50-e312a626b22a","expr":"(opcode != 169) || var >= 0","rationale":"For the RET opcode (169), the var must be a valid non-negative local variable index.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573107971Z"}
{"id":"ed58cc03-77c9-4d5e-9e9c-01345d6c41aa","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode often represents JVM instruction codes that are non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573156964Z"}
{"id":"b9578764-b3e2-40e0-bca5-ba3150a2ae9d","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string passed to visitTypeInsn cannot be null as it is used in method calls.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573156964Z"}
