{"id":"5102f140-9ea0-4379-ace2-98096a9a94cd","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"visitVarInsn should only be called with opcodes corresponding to variable instructions, which are not zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitVarInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.573107971Z"}
