{"id":"2023616d-2480-498a-9a50-1bb2e00c898e","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcodes are generally non-negative integers representing JVM instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.574882232Z"}
