{"id":"632382ac-849b-4ca3-bedd-f1dfd3759865","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"opcode is expected to be a valid bytecode instruction opcode, typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.575823714Z"}
