{"id":"73f79fb7-27a2-4151-af29-c3607cb30b70","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name should be non-null to identify the method being invoked.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.576180335Z"}
{"id":"72ee58c2-32bb-4bfd-87be-25b7f25857a1","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor string should be non-null to represent the method's signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.576180335Z"}
{"id":"1aab90b9-bd8b-4cc4-9868-ccf013438949","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode should be non-negative as it represents a valid bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.576180335Z"}
{"id":"6627adbd-c0cc-432a-966e-b2f196171930","expr":"!owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner string should not be empty as it represents the class that owns the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.576180335Z"}
{"id":"ea8f8221-1b4b-4a92-90e2-9936ba904bbd","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The 'owner' parameter typically represents a class or interface name and must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.578870320Z"}
{"id":"99308178-7f39-46ca-83b1-eb20fff9c84e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Method name must be defined for meaningful method invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.578870320Z"}
{"id":"68e5f5fb-93d8-409e-a83e-87422f588685","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Method descriptor is required to describe parameter and return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.578870320Z"}
{"id":"e5470e6b-5add-441b-b5bb-9edfb5ef8987","expr":"(opcode >= 0) && (opcode <= 255)","rationale":"Opcode is an unsigned byte value that identifies the bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.578870320Z"}
{"id":"436a726e-039a-492d-bdf1-e7ce3418b820","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method delegates jump instructions to two other method visitors, so label must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579565498Z"}
{"id":"7f59dcef-ce12-4ea7-a39c-02ea659c22ad","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"The opcode parameter represents a JVM bytecode instruction opcode which are in the range 0 to 255.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579565498Z"}
{"id":"3ccad693-81fe-43e9-90af-948b2be58023","expr":"owner != null && name != null && desc != null || opcode == 0 && !itf","rationale":"Method call instructions require non-null owner, name, and desc unless this is a no-op opcode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579614160Z"}
{"id":"26a873bc-50bb-4c8a-8b40-ffc948775a70","expr":"(opcode >= 182 && opcode <= 185) == itf","rationale":"The itf boolean indicates whether the method is an interface method, and opcode value corresponds accordingly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579614160Z"}
{"id":"4a3fa861-30d3-4c23-ae6a-db36ed90545b","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Method descriptor strings have a standard format starting with '('.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579614160Z"}
{"id":"904c26f4-3a14-4f4f-99fa-0a6a179f5d6b","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since label is passed as an argument to visitJumpInsn calls, it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579972234Z"}
{"id":"5b3a17f2-a899-4d8a-8598-1c64754551ca","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode represents a bytecode operation code which are typically non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579972234Z"}
{"id":"d322d886-cd51-4893-ad72-5497dd6a6d5f","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The method name is a non-empty string identifying the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579614160Z"}
{"id":"ac6b6d31-d5b3-451e-b1f8-1157a7728adc","expr":"opcode == 183 || opcode == 182 || opcode == 185 || opcode == 184","rationale":"opcode corresponds to method invocation instructions like invokespecial, invokevirtual, invokeinterface, or invokestatic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.579614160Z"}
{"id":"b5feed44-c997-44aa-ae31-88d62e2c31c6","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter must not be null because it is passed to other methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.580271928Z"}
{"id":"d8187805-7355-4670-84be-1785e657a511","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Since the method calls mv1.visitLabel(label) and mv2.visitLabel(label), label must be non-null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.581518455Z"}
{"id":"9a86a0e6-fe4d-4f8d-beb7-83a2b9c9eebc","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant 'cst' passed to visitLdcInsn is typically non-null as it's an operand for ldc instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.582406237Z"}
{"id":"894776b0-3267-47ab-9ecc-3d0ecce677e3","expr":"cst != null","rationale":"The constant object cst is forwarded to two method visitors, so it is likely non-null to avoid NPE in the downstream visitLdcInsn calls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.584678034Z"}
{"id":"2af14834-9b1c-4ccb-9da1-81fafd439bf9","expr":"cst.getClass().isInstance(cst)","rationale":"cst is an Object so it is trivially an instance of its own class, reinforcing type consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.584678034Z"}
{"id":"456d532d-56ca-4169-83a8-feab74f390f5","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"In Java bytecode, the variable index (var) used in IINC instructions is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585100910Z"}
{"id":"fed0b231-2a51-43ef-90dc-7be88980cbb1","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Increment is usually non-zero since incrementing by zero would be a no-op.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585100910Z"}
{"id":"60fb74f1-307e-44c5-b6b8-98b92650a37c","expr":"increment >= -128 && increment <= 127","rationale":"In JVM bytecode, the IINC instruction's increment parameter is a signed byte, typically between -128 and 127.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585100910Z"}
{"id":"5ba6ecba-2fae-47b0-a85b-372fda13c6a1","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"The increment parameter usually specifies a non-zero value since zero increment would be redundant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585853817Z"}
{"id":"9511cebc-0ab0-4ab5-8fe6-ed349147ba93","expr":"var >= 0","rationale":"Java local variable indices are never negative, so var should be >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585853817Z"}
{"id":"ae59e872-96d6-4bc9-a4ec-e0c90d7bfec7","expr":"Integer.valueOf(var).equals(Integer.valueOf(var))","rationale":"No meaningful invariant, just allowed method usage example","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585853817Z"}
{"id":"7e868c8e-0224-47e6-8672-86a07ab75028","expr":"(var & 1) == 0 || (var & 1) == 1","rationale":"Bitwise property; explicitly trivial but can be meaningful for more advanced reasoning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585853817Z"}
{"id":"bc2821a4-7284-497f-a52f-be55a82af93f","expr":"var < 65536","rationale":"Local variable indices typically fit in a 16-bit index.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585853817Z"}
{"id":"09ccf2d1-cdbc-44bf-9274-1df77adb684c","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels parameter is passed directly without null check, so it is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585866501Z"}
{"id":"02df1ea4-fe23-45e7-89fa-1da36088adeb","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"For the table switch instruction, max should be greater than or equal to min, as this represents a valid range of switch keys.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585866501Z"}
{"id":"91e3c69c-65dd-470b-af00-cf22c09c521f","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The labels array should have one label for each possible key value between min and max inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585866501Z"}
{"id":"9e8e3273-2383-4d4a-a138-4da6545d829d","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the switch instruction is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.585866501Z"}
{"id":"3feed18b-795c-4f89-a604-e55dfc4dbdd3","expr":"keys != null","rationale":"keys array must be non-null to represent switch keys","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587143015Z"}
{"id":"e8d2116e-644b-4066-ab05-dd72a1635a49","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"labels array must be non-null to represent switch target labels","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587143015Z"}
{"id":"7cea79f9-7eb8-43bc-bb0b-3195f1f8991f","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"Each key corresponds to a label in lookup switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587143015Z"}
{"id":"042bcdb5-ff90-413a-abe1-234b1bb61331","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"Default label for unmatched keys must be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587143015Z"}
{"id":"6b200e9a-d094-4c64-915f-999e4567cfcd","expr":"max >= min","rationale":"The switch range must have max greater or equal to min for valid table switch","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587061842Z"}
{"id":"2c7934f1-9de7-4623-b529-e4f57a5eafd4","expr":"labels != null","rationale":"The labels array parameter should not be null to properly dispatch switch cases","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587061842Z"}
{"id":"9ba40a75-043d-4520-b09b-89c5731f8395","expr":"labels.length == max - min + 1","rationale":"The number of labels must be exactly max-min+1 to cover all switch keys in the range","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587061842Z"}
{"id":"cdd20d3a-1465-46f3-960d-a0da4f92d40f","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"A default label must always be provided","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587061842Z"}
{"id":"9f4fcb19-8b2e-4794-b6c6-4225dfbe8b0f","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The arrays keys and labels must be non-null and have equal length to represent the switch cases properly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587935887Z"}
{"id":"bf57a874-88eb-4d09-b9ee-837375354e61","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label dflt should not be null as it specifies the default case of the switch.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.587935887Z"}
{"id":"79cebad5-fdac-43ba-b232-b35ba30b2a11","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc should be non-null because it is passed to the delegate visitTypeInsn methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.589788836Z"}
{"id":"8ba6b621-d415-4bf8-8003-84a64b50ce3e","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc length should be positive since it represents a valid type descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.589788836Z"}
{"id":"3b1f9627-f3da-4ddd-ab68-03b70adc8b47","expr":"!(opcode == 187 && (desc == null || desc.length() == 0))","rationale":"If opcode is 187 (NEW), then desc must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.589788836Z"}
{"id":"06e1cb53-fe45-4d0b-8de9-83ea6b2e9409","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The descriptor string 'desc' must not be null to represent a valid type descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590348289Z"}
{"id":"c563784c-0513-4cd4-ad90-561d195104c7","expr":"dims >= 1","rationale":"The number of dimensions specified by 'dims' should be at least 1 as arrays have at least one dimension.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590348289Z"}
{"id":"f86350e4-a38a-45a3-8fc4-b826533bb5ec","expr":"dims <= 255","rationale":"The JVM specification limits the number of array dimensions to 255 for multi-dimensional new array instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590348289Z"}
{"id":"f01df263-d3bf-4fdd-9815-5244e18b737e","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"The descriptor string should have length greater than zero to represent valid type information.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590348289Z"}
{"id":"69ea1638-6b0a-46b0-b2aa-f001d6cc036c","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc is passed to two method calls and therefore should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590810890Z"}
{"id":"0e5c9094-dcb3-496d-b794-5c6eabe0d985","expr":"dims > 0","rationale":"dims represents the number of dimensions for new multi-array creation and must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590810890Z"}
{"id":"d9d6f51b-edad-41c3-bb0e-93613e1cf69e","expr":"desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc is expected to be a non-empty descriptor string for the type of the array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590810890Z"}
{"id":"5822f8ee-9fb8-4d93-975d-719839838a5a","expr":"desc.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for multi-dimensional arrays typically starts with '[' characters equal to dims.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590810890Z"}
{"id":"399e06c4-d8c9-4594-86be-1c80768d1fd0","expr":"desc.indexOf('[') >= 0","rationale":"desc should contain at least one '[' as part of describing the multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.590810890Z"}
{"id":"5597e171-60fe-4f9f-84c7-1136f0d9ae0e","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.591848904Z"}
{"id":"c89f3ca2-1779-499f-a625-c3c473fb7023","expr":"end != null","rationale":"The end label of a try-catch block is typically expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.591848904Z"}
{"id":"6254bec7-f577-48ed-8935-0d957ca9c079","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"The handler label for a catch block should not be null since it represents a valid code region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.591848904Z"}
{"id":"b97ee6e2-e8ec-4dd4-9239-47614cd44349","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The start label should be different from the end label to define a non-empty try block region.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.591848904Z"}
{"id":"4f0b6242-933f-48cf-9e25-9ce211429a2f","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"If the type string is not null, it should be non-empty indicating a valid exception type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.591848904Z"}
{"id":"8b9bcc8f-4cee-44bb-9d75-60fd9e353b4e","expr":"start != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, start label must be non-null as it marks the beginning of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.592859938Z"}
{"id":"a2db9b95-1118-44e3-ad30-9e94d5a1a478","expr":"end != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, end label must be non-null as it marks the end of the block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.592859938Z"}
{"id":"ca2cec3a-6d80-4f81-bab7-2f215a34949f","expr":"handler != null","rationale":"At the end of visitTryCatchBlock, handler label must be non-null since it marks the catch block.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.592859938Z"}
{"id":"6f8d258a-6a97-48ab-8ea1-830fc252273a","expr":"(type == null) || (type.length() > 0)","rationale":"Type string, if not null, should be a non-empty exception class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.592859938Z"}
{"id":"be4ef0b8-40cd-4b4b-bed8-de0f210d96ce","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The try block must span a non-empty range so start and end labels should differ.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.592859938Z"}
{"id":"9703668c-63e1-4fe1-a9fb-87c86e714601","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The parameter 'name' representing the variable's identifier is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593426073Z"}
{"id":"eb20373b-84c3-437c-ae11-44bc0733a9fa","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Local variable descriptor should be non-null for proper bytecode generation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593426073Z"}
{"id":"4bf023d8-67e9-4639-9b23-7adf6a29166e","expr":"start != null","rationale":"Non-null 'start' label is expected to mark the scope of the local variable.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593426073Z"}
{"id":"fed765a7-a837-4424-bcca-6b4be4f18dc4","expr":"end != null","rationale":"Non-null 'end' label is required to mark the scope end of the local variable.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593426073Z"}
{"id":"df863129-03ea-4b87-9666-98a6d732bc3c","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The 'index' parameter identifies the slot position and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593426073Z"}
{"id":"5cf01601-283c-46ad-80b0-892d4ed29397","expr":"name != null","rationale":"visitLocalVariable is expected to receive a non-null name for the local variable","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593657589Z"}
{"id":"3d88d374-ef85-4e76-9669-d7c825bc6be4","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"desc must be non-null to represent a valid type descriptor","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593657589Z"}
{"id":"c58beba0-50cf-44cb-9656-2908938d8d44","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index parameter represents the local variable slot index which is zero or positive","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593657589Z"}
{"id":"3d12789d-68f2-4917-869d-bee2d0cee6c6","expr":"start != null && end != null","rationale":"Labels define the scope of the local variable and must be defined","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593657589Z"}
{"id":"48a1384e-9fff-4987-9226-d8554d3e684f","expr":"start.getOffset() <= end.getOffset()","rationale":"For proper variable scope, the start label should occur before or at the end label","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLocalVariable(String,String,String,Label,Label,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593657589Z"}
{"id":"8ff4017c-79b1-434f-aac1-484d9e432191","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in source code or bytecode generally start from 0 or 1 and should not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593900236Z"}
{"id":"344c2537-1762-42c2-8dc2-14924adca324","expr":"start != null","rationale":"Labels used to mark positions in bytecode are expected to be non-null at the point of invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.593900236Z"}
{"id":"b94f6755-ddd3-449f-aa52-5b19ef951b6c","expr":"line >= 0","rationale":"Line numbers in bytecode represent source code line numbers and are normally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.595526007Z"}
{"id":"5642eb5a-da0b-48e5-8947-1f9542b3635d","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The start label is used as a marker for a line number and must be a valid Label instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.595526007Z"}
{"id":"838cf6ba-b6c0-4005-881a-69f9644bb57d","expr":"line > 0 || line == 0","rationale":"Technically covers lines at zero and positive, emphasizing line number range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.595526007Z"}
{"id":"f34ee3d0-c339-4e0f-bec1-5b215106f3fc","expr":"start.getClass() == start.getClass()","rationale":"This is not useful practically but shows that start is a valid Label instance.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.595526007Z"}
{"id":"21e1cca4-d035-4436-84a4-d8561483ac4a","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"Operand stack size cannot be negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596088235Z"}
{"id":"72b664a9-449e-4830-9a15-9a341d4729ff","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"Local variables count cannot be negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596088235Z"}
{"id":"86a7af97-8e8d-470b-88a8-7d74db23e714","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals || maxLocals >= maxStack","rationale":"No inherent ordering, but are sizes so non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596088235Z"}
{"id":"bd5ecdf1-b0d0-4ec6-9427-50b57fd240f6","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"Stack size cannot be negative in JVM bytecode verification.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596709946Z"}
{"id":"ec4928bc-e4b9-4979-8ce6-cbedf365115a","expr":"maxLocals >= 0","rationale":"Number of local variables cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596709946Z"}
{"id":"2b4c9845-e198-434f-85ad-a67fa0ed497a","expr":"maxStack >= maxLocals","rationale":"Typically, stack size is at least as large as number of locals needed for method execution.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596709946Z"}
{"id":"bb5bb0ad-2914-4bd9-919d-0f0608053eb3","expr":"maxStack <= 65535","rationale":"JVM spec limits stack size to a maximum of 65535.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596709946Z"}
{"id":"054fa8be-1219-42da-9c71-3e01c9d64d67","expr":"maxLocals <= 65535","rationale":"JVM spec limits local variables count to 65535.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.596709946Z"}
{"id":"28203ab3-1f94-405d-9150-f7fefe2a59d2","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method delegates to other visitParameter methods which likely require a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599325871Z"}
{"id":"62df83fe-f2e6-4f52-ba3f-ea71e2ff6f15","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"Typically access represents a set of bit flags; negative values are unusual.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599325871Z"}
{"id":"44697166-f6c0-423e-9b9d-36a5544d3e9f","expr":"(name == null) || (name.length() >= 0)","rationale":"Ensures that calling name.length() is safe in some usages in the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599325871Z"}
{"id":"7a290d54-42de-41df-894f-edc7b9938961","expr":"access >= 0 && access <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"Access flags typically fit within a 16-bit integer range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599805985Z"}
{"id":"c9bcd129-55cb-4d70-ace0-f4b499c7fddb","expr":"name == null || !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"If name is not null, it should not be empty as parameters generally have meaningful names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599805985Z"}
{"id":"8d93e9e8-ac4a-47ef-8076-316c22135cd5","expr":"!(name != null && access == 0)","rationale":"If name is non-null, access flags are likely non-zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitParameter(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.599805985Z"}
{"id":"7e0ec305-5740-4bf1-90b1-caa65461ddba","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The 'desc' parameter is a descriptor string likely required and non-null for type annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.600222809Z"}
{"id":"44733403-355e-471a-b902-d5a1a356ed52","expr":"(typePath == null) || (typePath.getLength() >= 0)","rationale":"If typePath is not null, its length should be non-negative representing a valid path.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.600222809Z"}
{"id":"a90a6272-323b-4a0d-bdf9-67cf38ae30d3","expr":"typeRef >= 0","rationale":"typeRef is typically an int encoding a reference, expected to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.600222809Z"}
{"id":"9c17f9e4-4ba8-4567-91c9-e19942b11883","expr":"typeRef <= 0xFFFF","rationale":"typeRef values are constrained to fit within 16 bits as per JVM spec for type annotations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.600222809Z"}
{"id":"b8234d93-03bc-45e3-98b6-85186732973f","expr":"(desc.length() > 0)","rationale":"desc is a descriptor string expected to be non-empty for the annotation type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.600222809Z"}
{"id":"ec6f6369-2a7c-450d-a238-9b2b65e04d2d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor from getInstance wrapping two visits is guaranteed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601238371Z"}
{"id":"032c086b-face-479f-a19b-aa9cafd17d59","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method visitor's visitInvokeDynamicInsn requires a valid method name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601831488Z"}
{"id":"2bf98e56-c468-4fe0-bc80-0c5ed6974430","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"The method descriptor specifies method signature and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601831488Z"}
{"id":"bf5b4e7f-8ce5-450c-94eb-1d2a6e81e0ad","expr":"bsm != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method handle (bsm) must be non-null for a valid invoke dynamic instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601831488Z"}
{"id":"cd0677d5-cc52-4509-82cc-3a8f1cd2a1ea","expr":"bsmArgs != null","rationale":"The argument array to bootstrap method should exist, even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601831488Z"}
{"id":"97a74467-ef3b-4b9b-ab8d-f19f55f3a0c5","expr":"bsmArgs.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"The parameter bsmArgs is declared as Object but expected to be an Object array at runtime.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.601831488Z"}
{"id":"f4f95707-6966-4ebc-8103-c25c99155701","expr":"name != null","rationale":"Invocation of mv1 and mv2 passes name; name must be valid and non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.602619061Z"}
{"id":"61032f12-0a73-4772-8478-6ff0a883daaf","expr":"desc != null","rationale":"Descriptor for method signature must be non-null for bytecode generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.602619061Z"}
{"id":"c1c650c7-6bb1-4af1-919a-83565c31ba83","expr":"bsm != null","rationale":"Bootstrap method handle is passed and necessary for invokedynamic call.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.602619061Z"}
{"id":"0c47329b-e991-4f5a-ac9e-53444bae2640","expr":"bsmArgs != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method arguments array is passed along; it should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.602619061Z"}
{"id":"13b3704a-2732-4a51-8a8e-53964c005a89","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an instance from AnnotationVisitorTee.getInstance, likely non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.604025789Z"}
{"id":"34c1887f-c88d-49cf-943a-444c2fddd451","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns field 'e', which is expected to be non-null at the return point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.Block#getCodeEmitter():CodeEmitter","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/Block.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:00.604141948Z"}
