{"id":"1a200b68-d88c-48d4-9c0a-0db66721b970","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method uses callbackTypes.length and callbackTypes[i], so callbackTypes must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870566785Z"}
{"id":"0e5e6716-bf81-45a2-b731-7f043d7314fa","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is naturally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870566785Z"}
{"id":"c3563fd0-ffac-466f-8cbe-3ca821a5a2d7","expr":"!checkAll || callbackTypes.length > 0","rationale":"If checkAll is true, the array likely contains types to check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870566785Z"}
{"id":"e9beeb70-a3f3-4b50-970e-f6d993a2c8dd","expr":"result != null && result.length == (callbackTypes == null ? 0 : callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"Since the method transforms callbackTypes array to a Type[] result array, their lengths should correspond when callbackTypes is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870580050Z"}
{"id":"73d01739-b827-4686-bcd1-4c0feb7a0b30","expr":"callbackTypes == null || result != null","rationale":"The returned array should not be null if input array is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870580050Z"}
{"id":"5f36f798-471d-44af-acd4-b37c5f0be52e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is expected to return a non-null Type[] regardless of input (even if input is null).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.870580050Z"}
{"id":"4e6d7afc-0215-4731-b2d6-6d1d378ad667","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a new array of Type objects corresponding to callbackTypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.871994904Z"}
{"id":"9d1f4252-0f35-4048-8781-23ddb589e387","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"By construction, result array is allocated with length equal to callbackTypes.length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.871994904Z"}
{"id":"a931de26-7feb-44f5-a58f-b2b85bb88eca","expr":"callbackTypes == null || (result.length == callbackTypes.length)","rationale":"If callbackTypes is null, method may throw earlier or handle accordingly; otherwise length must match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.871994904Z"}
{"id":"69aa44da-1bfc-4d7f-a905-b3bddffb8cef","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null array of callbacks to operate correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.872547685Z"}
{"id":"f9c2c1c3-eca1-4e45-8c78-b6ae9d9c8dbd","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths in Java are always non-negative, so this holds at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.872547685Z"}
{"id":"1820e0e2-8915-4954-a729-196965661f6f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the method context, determineTypes returns a Type array which is assigned directly from another method call, which is expected not to return null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873384069Z"}
{"id":"945b3e49-a8c1-4595-837c-b01c5684b0bb","expr":"callbacks == null || result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"Typically determineTypes map each Callback to one Type, so array sizes are expected to be equal when callbacks is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873384069Z"}
{"id":"4f103671-92d7-4827-baa2-a833542a518c","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of result, an array, is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873384069Z"}
{"id":"ac93ed65-2188-4d4b-aa0e-77e350e55f74","expr":"callbacks != null && callbacks.length == 0 || result.length == 0","rationale":"If the input callbacks array is empty, then the result array is expected to be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873384069Z"}
{"id":"e5b5f266-ec6f-4076-a0bc-e3e4288802d5","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"To safely process the array of Classes, callbackTypes must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.872020452Z"}
{"id":"60c3a545-bf9f-44d9-8dad-bb03c9616979","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of callbackTypes, as a Java array, cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.872020452Z"}
{"id":"ec33a8a1-075b-428f-876d-354d98bb106a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a new Type[] array of the same length as callbacks, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873600817Z"}
{"id":"44a55176-c99c-410e-ad75-801f1a8db783","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The returned Type array length equals callbacks.length as seen from the code creating a new array of this length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873600817Z"}
{"id":"23205954-93cc-4d57-bfa6-3748cf22cdb3","expr":"callbacks.length == 0 || (result[0] != null)","rationale":"If callbacks is non-empty, the first element of result is assigned the return of determineType which presumably returns a valid Type meaning result[0] != null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873600817Z"}
{"id":"261b67c0-84d5-464f-b3f6-6166a63fdbb7","expr":"!checkAll || (result.length > 0)","rationale":"The checkAll flag does not directly affect the length but given the code use, if checkAll is true, callbacks.length (and thus result.length) could be expected to be positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873600817Z"}
{"id":"99891c6d-ecca-4303-8fa0-55ebb047f101","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.873600817Z"}
{"id":"0b15e8c5-2a7c-4e7a-9316-10be7fdcf1bf","expr":"callbackTypes != null","rationale":"The method immediately uses callbackTypes.length in array creation, so callbackTypes must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.874736175Z"}
{"id":"635a5895-69cf-43fe-b144-b3f2501e8ad9","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of an array in Java is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.874736175Z"}
{"id":"cc361228-74e9-4bf5-8417-e1fad79b4f97","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0 && callbackTypes.length <= 1000","rationale":"Bounds hinting for array size; upper bound is speculative but common.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.874736175Z"}
{"id":"662cfdd8-dd0e-4f60-a4c6-12909856e78a","expr":"result != null && result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method returns an array of CallbackGenerator with the same length as callbackTypes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875054905Z"}
{"id":"dc0bf67a-c057-46ef-95f5-22eaf1817854","expr":"callbackTypes != null || result == null","rationale":"The method may produce a null result only if input is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875054905Z"}
{"id":"1045b307-39ba-4f5a-93a8-ccb364d1a9ef","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method initializes the result array before returning.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875054905Z"}
{"id":"3a39ea28-913e-4f2e-b5ee-54a525c736d6","expr":"(result != null)","rationale":"Presuming that the determineType method never returns null, result is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875828070Z"}
{"id":"4d9a7025-2fac-420e-ba4c-ca43aa12cf43","expr":"result != null && result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(callback.getClass())","rationale":"The result Type is related to the class of the callback instance, reflecting that callback is an instance of a class compatible with the returned Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875828070Z"}
{"id":"cc246d93-ce1e-4fbf-adab-f6b3febc13c3","expr":"result != null && callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Since callback is non-null, its class is also non-null and result is presumably non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.875828070Z"}
{"id":"b34e5ebb-db00-4bb7-9846-f7c9ece21b18","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls isAssignableFrom on info.cls with callbackType, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.876801543Z"}
{"id":"ce55d4a3-9c2a-47e3-9ccb-cc8131443056","expr":"callbackType.isInterface() || !callbackType.isArray()","rationale":"A callback type generally represents a class or interface type, not an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.876801543Z"}
{"id":"a780b2f8-44f8-49a7-a38a-82675bc2286b","expr":"!checkAll || callbackType != null","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackType must be non-null to proceed with assignments.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.876801543Z"}
{"id":"97f2900b-d8e9-4515-b1c3-4fba55575325","expr":"checkAll || true","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean so it is either true or false (trivial but valid).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.876801543Z"}
{"id":"ed3d8f27-8c37-40ee-8441-088a3cb90360","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Because if no assignable type is found, an exception is thrown, so result is always assigned a non-null Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877285464Z"}
{"id":"445dd0c5-22e3-421c-ad99-cbd7a6e92f77","expr":"!checkAll || result != null","rationale":"If !checkAll is true, early return occurs; but result is always non-null if return occurs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877285464Z"}
{"id":"e85a6da6-be00-4572-8249-d7464b9bb94e","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The code generation requires a non-null ClassEmitter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877490871Z"}
{"id":"8911f0cc-a80b-4e28-907e-eb42919ae024","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Code generation depends on a valid context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877490871Z"}
{"id":"a4260571-5611-42bb-9cf4-8a9cfa4dc13e","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method implementation list must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877490871Z"}
{"id":"2afdb1ec-7226-420d-acc3-cfce7edd80d7","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, code generation implies methods are available.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877490871Z"}
{"id":"7e36420a-3e16-433b-b33c-a5ae8a36f728","expr":"methods.iterator() != null","rationale":"Having a valid iterator for methods is required before entering the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877490871Z"}
{"id":"1cd462a0-c38f-436a-8d70-eab787379956","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a generator retrieved from CALLBACKS, which is never null if found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878059922Z"}
{"id":"e931af6c-9507-4a7e-b0c6-797119301cad","expr":"result.getClass().getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"The generator class inherits from a superclass, indicating expected class hierarchy.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878059922Z"}
{"id":"eb7837da-be16-46fc-91f7-820d32419b8e","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method calls callbackType.equals, so callbackType must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877773343Z"}
{"id":"82c41619-9604-42e3-94d7-1e04c88bafb0","expr":"callbackType.getClass().getName() != null","rationale":"The getClass name of callbackType is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877773343Z"}
{"id":"2fcd12ed-8417-4bc0-9fb2-acb9efbab1ac","expr":"!callbackType.equals(null)","rationale":"callbackType.equals(null) should be false by the equals contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerator(Type):CallbackGenerator","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.877773343Z"}
{"id":"0401d827-bb5f-40a2-bf8d-8a98eb6cbabf","expr":"methods != null && !methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The generate method iterates over methods, so methods list is expected to be non-null and typically non-empty for effective code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878384293Z"}
{"id":"49c5c6e3-820a-43b3-af04-646fb32cc508","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter should be non-null to declare fields and generate methods as the method implements code generation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878384293Z"}
{"id":"f78b99ff-a66c-4d0c-92cb-787152b9414e","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The context is used extensively to get implementation signature, begin method generation and emit callbacks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878384293Z"}
{"id":"83357058-d11e-4453-91b6-c863d4142290","expr":"!methods.isEmpty() || ce.getName() != null","rationale":"If methods list is empty (unusual but possible), ClassEmitter should have a valid name to ensure the class context exists.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878384293Z"}
{"id":"9a438f40-9344-4077-8439-ba2a48dfb7fe","expr":"e != null","rationale":"CodeEmitter e is used as an object reference to invoke methods inside the method body, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.879505273Z"}
{"id":"e37e4b2d-1088-4b75-b952-249e97c2ddc8","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context context is utilized for method calls like context.getImplSignature(...) hence must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.879505273Z"}
{"id":"1581d62b-efcd-4076-93e6-f1757f4a3166","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The methods list is iterated over; it must be non-null to prevent NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.879505273Z"}
{"id":"71760a91-a1a5-4a6a-958d-8d91f0deaea9","expr":"methods.isEmpty() || methods.iterator().hasNext()","rationale":"If methods is not empty, its iterator must have elements to process in the method body.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.879505273Z"}
{"id":"950a1e81-c1cd-48d2-b964-829f318136f0","expr":"callbacks != null","rationale":"The method creates an array using callbacks.length, so callbacks must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878851903Z"}
{"id":"a31325ef-e32b-4dfd-8818-1a92b5290d08","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878851903Z"}
{"id":"96cd9272-5477-4c6d-b6d9-af976ca43865","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"checkAll is a boolean parameter; this is trivial but explicitly stated","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.878851903Z"}
