{"id":"54d8e381-2dbf-440a-b599-9783339ff5b3","expr":"impl.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Method signatures typically have names that are non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885166271Z"}
{"id":"dc8c5532-8390-45ae-834d-4fbff437f2ee","expr":"impl.getName().indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"The method appends \"$Proxy\", so the original name likely does not contain '$' to avoid conflicts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885166271Z"}
{"id":"d2cf7bdc-419e-4062-8308-d6d6e388b2aa","expr":"methods != null && context != null && e != null && !methods.isEmpty() || methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The methods list and context and code emitter e must be non-null for this method to execute; it iterates over methods which may be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.InvocationHandlerGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/InvocationHandlerGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.879799077Z"}
