{"id":"a160c38e-701c-4956-ae46-d227ded87b12","expr":"impl.getName().equals(impl.getName())","rationale":"impl.getName is consistent on each call","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886335182Z"}
{"id":"85053f78-b690-4aab-adea-79a181cfe3bb","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since result is impl.getName() + \"$Proxy\", and assuming impl.getName() returns a non-null string, result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885490582Z"}
{"id":"7b99ac2e-8e2f-4b79-89d9-aa2f68a055b6","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"The method returns impl.getName() concatenated with \"$Proxy\", so result starts with impl.getName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodProxyField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885490582Z"}
{"id":"a05c3e97-88c9-4563-b46f-88a81e75389b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result is formed by concatenation of impl.getName() with a constant string, so it should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885245510Z"}
{"id":"ecfba02a-2109-4577-bca9-b2714ea030f3","expr":"result.startsWith(impl.getName())","rationale":"result always starts with the signature's name impl.getName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885245510Z"}
{"id":"bb6a8a76-f053-4d70-ab28-0179838fbb5c","expr":"result.length() == impl.getName().length() + 7","rationale":"result length equals impl name length plus length of the suffix \"$Method\".","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#getMethodField(Signature):String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.885245510Z"}
