{"id":"9779f300-477f-4ebf-ae90-19ecb7332053","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The method likely requires a valid ClassEmitter to generate bytecode; therefore, ce should be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886798514Z"}
{"id":"e98f1730-4941-4862-bbd7-e0ec31e3e036","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context object is used to obtain implementation signatures and method indexes, so it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886798514Z"}
{"id":"b8b08620-c695-4862-92ff-ff802a9410a3","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The method iterates over the methods list; consequently, the list must be defined at the exit point.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886798514Z"}
{"id":"0760407a-4a59-4f27-b8e0-ea255419ad6a","expr":"methods.size() >= 0","rationale":"Regardless of content, a list has a non-negative size. This invariant states that the collection is a valid list.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886798514Z"}
{"id":"6e9b4d87-1c55-44bc-8825-35c7e8673f84","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter parameter 'ce' is essential for code generation to proceed and thus should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886500443Z"}
{"id":"d61c2660-9e1c-4605-9112-22cf62a5053c","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The Context parameter provides necessary contextual information for method generation and should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886500443Z"}
{"id":"b6acc6d6-593b-41ef-891f-88b045f61ece","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' list must be defined so the method implementation can iterate and generate code for them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886500443Z"}
{"id":"72d2eb8e-f0f3-4033-8e88-be0d24a4146f","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"If there were no methods, the generation would be trivial or skipped, so typically 'methods' contain some entries.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generate(ClassEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.886500443Z"}
{"id":"9b203da0-7fb6-4759-9172-c8de3a3f9e28","expr":"e != null && method != null && context != null","rationale":"The method operates on e, method, and context by calling methods, so they must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.892104433Z"}
{"id":"38b9737a-8a4a-4ed7-9a0e-33f36f08f95e","expr":"method.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Modifiers are typically non-negative integers representing bit fields.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.892104433Z"}
{"id":"31046258-6889-495c-ae7f-95d6a28d7fdd","expr":"context.getClass().isInstance(context)","rationale":"context must be an instance of Context per its declaration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#superHelper(CodeEmitter,MethodInfo,Context):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.892104433Z"}
{"id":"2a9dbb58-851e-44c1-a317-04ac8e8f640c","expr":"context != null","rationale":"Context must be non-null for method body to function correctly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893299834Z"}
{"id":"efee7206-2fa4-4f2f-9318-a74e8b2b097c","expr":"!methods.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method accesses elements from the list, so empty list would cause exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893299834Z"}
{"id":"ef63fc6b-5259-47b6-82ef-4bcacf1b1e92","expr":"methods != null","rationale":"The 'methods' parameter is used throughout the method and should not be null at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893634314Z"}
{"id":"54f75ac9-30f3-40ab-bc87-3e53ed4bfcc6","expr":"context != null","rationale":"The 'context' parameter is used to obtain method signatures and should not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893634314Z"}
{"id":"876cca34-bfcb-45c5-8e22-418edc44d764","expr":"e != null","rationale":"The CodeEmitter 'e' is used extensively and must be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893634314Z"}
{"id":"cbb17950-8d0a-457c-8153-44443a491f5d","expr":"methods.size() >= 0","rationale":"The 'methods' list size is non-negative as it is a List.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateStatic(CodeEmitter,Context,List):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893634314Z"}
{"id":"126f664f-4ad8-4b7b-b344-1cd0d791d711","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"ClassEmitter ce must not be null to begin method emission.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateFindProxy(ClassEmitter,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893978051Z"}
