{"id":"6352545f-34ab-4a80-992a-5a853830db95","expr":"sigMap.size() >= 0","rationale":"sigMap size must be non-negative and may be used in looping or switch logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateFindProxy(ClassEmitter,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.893978051Z"}
{"id":"f7e5750b-b6a0-43f2-a3ee-d6ea8396569d","expr":"ce != null","rationale":"The ClassEmitter 'ce' must be non-null to generate bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateFindProxy(ClassEmitter,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.894170202Z"}
{"id":"b4bc32fb-0cb1-425f-beae-1b6e426a5403","expr":"sigMap != null","rationale":"The sigMap maintains the mapping from signature strings to corresponding field names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptorGenerator#generateFindProxy(ClassEmitter,Map):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodInterceptorGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.894170202Z"}
{"id":"2ff4600d-e2bd-4322-be16-249e3971b28a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method initializes 'resolved' as a new HashMap and returns it or the same map after modifications, so 'result' cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.BridgeMethodResolver#resolveAll():Map","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/BridgeMethodResolver.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:01.897525439Z"}
