{"id":"dcea1092-3998-46ad-8b37-e875bb6aa306","expr":"attribute != null","rationale":"The method operates on the attribute parameter immediately; if it were null, it could cause a NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:03.179451500Z"}
