{"id":"db1ce3d6-4f92-4bdf-ad69-b1337f53160a","expr":"access >= 0","rationale":"The access parameter represents access flags and should be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:03.184590856Z"}
