{"id":"af114e16-ad86-48ae-a0bf-25e5b0936e39","expr":"permittedSubclass != null","rationale":"The method forwards permittedSubclass to another method without null check; it is likely expected not to be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:03.184393995Z"}
