{"id":"787104bd-94a1-404f-b50a-8910cd2d19ea","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"opcode is a JVM bytecode instruction opcode value, constrained within the byte range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.420876930Z"}
{"id":"0b33724b-2edb-47b2-8806-6f9ef2d3a355","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The type parameter is presumably non-null since it is forwarded to another visitTypeInsn method, which likely requires a non-null parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421551690Z"}
{"id":"0a876016-4d8a-4f50-a9de-d456f052450c","expr":"(opcode == 187) || (opcode == 192) || (opcode == 193) || (opcode == 198) || (opcode == 199)","rationale":"Reflects that the opcode argument should be one of the opcodes that classify type instructions in ASM.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421551690Z"}
{"id":"3e27a667-a06b-4c97-b9c0-b0885d2d14df","expr":"!((opcode == 198 || opcode == 199) && (type == null))","rationale":"Ensures no null type when specific opcodes are used for type-check instructions","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421551690Z"}
{"id":"102ca86e-6242-469c-a2b5-2befd4b27867","expr":"type.length() > 0","rationale":"A non-empty string is expected as a type descriptor","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTypeInsn(int,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421551690Z"}
{"id":"54b2c16d-19d6-4bd5-8b75-6be9e561c596","expr":"opcode >= 178 && opcode <= 181","rationale":"Opcode should be within the valid range for field instructions","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422195212Z"}
{"id":"1365afeb-f60f-491d-8219-996c32f33e87","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Owner string should be a valid internal class name","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422195212Z"}
{"id":"0f4b190e-c2c1-47c9-845c-77f6958d1f98","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Field name should be a non-empty string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422195212Z"}
{"id":"b1a3afce-f373-443c-ad5d-a6698b8b3166","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"Field descriptor should be non-empty","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422195212Z"}
{"id":"c7062637-b6d5-498e-94db-212df9386af8","expr":"(opcode == 178 || opcode == 180) == (descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty())","rationale":"For GETSTATIC and GETFIELD, descriptor must be valid","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422195212Z"}
