{"id":"9e4762f1-0053-4dff-b759-8becb1573525","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"A method's descriptor is necessary to identify parameter and return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.422716994Z"}
