{"id":"c9123d8d-859f-4e08-a7c4-f7ab7ca627ad","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"Field instructions refer to a class, so owner must not be null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421666266Z"}
