{"id":"0e1a425e-4300-448d-9972-e64a11a1abb9","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The 'descriptor' string describes the method's signature, and must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.423073826Z"}
{"id":"cf5d86aa-0d84-4f96-a6ce-60e140d6122c","expr":"(opcode >= 178 && opcode <= 181)","rationale":"In ASM library, field instructions opcodes are between 178 and 181 inclusive","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitFieldInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.421666266Z"}
{"id":"8d828b11-2fac-4e98-af40-55a451832af9","expr":"(opcode == 182 || opcode == 183 || opcode == 184 || opcode == 185)","rationale":"The valid opcodes for method invocation include INVOKEVIRTUAL(182), INVOKESPECIAL(183), INVOKESTATIC(184), INVOKEINTERFACE(185).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.423073826Z"}
{"id":"9475d1e2-c959-4e9e-81d5-62bb1448253e","expr":"(opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255)","rationale":"Opcode is an int but represents a byte-sized instruction code, so should be within 0-255.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.423073826Z"}
{"id":"0884c756-74d4-44d7-82f3-d71c4e6fa304","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'owner' string should represent the internal name of a class, typically non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.427165910Z"}
{"id":"d07c44ca-c7e9-4f47-b6b7-160eed2df0c5","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' argument should be a valid method name, thus non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.427165910Z"}
{"id":"3311aa02-d64e-4a24-80da-6a051b054503","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The 'descriptor' string should be a valid JVM method descriptor which starts with '('.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.427165910Z"}
