{"id":"2b0b5b7d-2fee-4ac5-bee7-13d4ff45b58e","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The name parameter is the method name to be invoked, and it should be a valid string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.428286069Z"}
{"id":"6536f099-3fbf-46f9-b73f-2b5932b62b5d","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The descriptor string represents the method signature; it must be non-null for valid invocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.428286069Z"}
