{"id":"dfae4c5a-27ca-4700-9c03-8036cc3db906","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null","rationale":"Bootstrap method handle identifies how the dynamic invocation is linked; it should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.429506206Z"}
