{"id":"a84941c1-dcca-47e7-8c11-ec241d9534bd","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"(\")","rationale":"Method descriptors in JVM bytecode conventions start with '(' denoting parameter types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.429506206Z"}
{"id":"1839b592-5413-4460-a1cf-c3945394d4b6","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The descriptor is expected to follow the JVM method descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.430356918Z"}
{"id":"c7b12645-ead7-4df4-8dad-d0efac0cd7ae","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle.getTag() >= 1 && bootstrapMethodHandle.getTag() <= 9","rationale":"The bootstrapMethodHandle tag is within expected JVM handle tag range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.430356918Z"}
{"id":"62c5cb61-1f3f-4c0e-9ecb-f27e3e10fe79","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method uses label as a parameter to the method it calls mv.visitJumpInsn, which likely requires a non-null Label.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.430886354Z"}
