{"id":"b92796bd-b910-44cb-9c25-1c1417af4a9f","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method ensures that an ObjectInstantiator instance is returned, either from cache or newly created.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#getInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.651916851Z"}
{"id":"39534440-4909-4ca3-a8b0-30b8ec22be18","expr":"result.getInstantiatedClass().equals(clazz)","rationale":"Each ObjectInstantiator associates with exactly one class, and here result's class should match clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.objenesis.SpringObjenesis#getInstantiatorOf(Class<T>):ObjectInstantiator<T>","file":"org/springframework/objenesis/SpringObjenesis.java","createdAt":"2026-09-08T06:38:05.651916851Z"}
